e":"Martin Queval"},"message":"feat(filecard): sélectionne par appui long\n\nRetirer la case à cocher libère le coin de la vignette, mais laisserait\nune carte sans aucun moyen d''être sélectionnée au doigt : ni clic droit\nni Ctrl+clic sur mobile.\n\nL''appui long (500 ms, immobile) bascule la sélection. Un doigt qui glisse\nfait défiler et n''enclenche rien ; le clic issu du relâchement n''ouvre pas\nla carte, sinon sélectionner reviendrait à ouvrir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N9dHUAHWFXKNgNNx5NKWjS","tree":{"sha":"2aef1fe8fabfde95802efe69918fa409d245e0ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MartinQueval/QVL-CanopUI/git/trees/2aef1fe8fabfde95802efe69918fa409d245e0ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MartinQueval/QVL-CanopUI/git/commits/9c7d6a0329a3a2b2df02afa623c097d8a362af86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116591403?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MartinQueval","id":116591403,"login":"MartinQueval","node_id":"U_kgDOBvMLKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinQueval","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https:/