98rochaGol","node_id":"U_kgDOEWsl_Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheus98rochaGol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matheusBrqRocha/koba/commits/86141a991397a0724ebb41d7812683d625a7f667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:33:44Z","email":"brq.mgrocha@voegol.com.br","name":"Matheus Rocha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:33:44Z","email":"brq.mgrocha@voegol.com.br","name":"Matheus Rocha"},"message":"refactor(compare): ciclo de vida explicito da sessao /compare\n\nConsolida o lifecycle da sessao de comparacao em mountCompareDetail, que\ne dono unico do listener de COMPARE_STATE_EVENT, do timer de escrita da\nURL e do painel de verify, retornando um dispose unico. syncCompareScreen\npassa a fazer dispose(); mount() ao trocar de sessao, no lugar de duas\nvariaveis mutaveis de modulo (stateListener/disposeVerify) que exigiam\n\"lembrar\" de limpar a sessao anterior.\n\nAdiciona cancelPendingUrlWrite em compareState para o dispose cancelar o\ndebounce de 250ms pendente. Fecha a classe de bug de lifecycle vazado que\nvinha sendo corrigida caso a caso (5fa6bd7, ded6f87) e cobre o caso antes\nsem dispose: sair do detalhe de volta para a lista.\n\nCandidato 2 do report de arquitetura (deepening).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a41dc535a1a0f64f33041c93271146eb0a298bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matheusBrqRocha/koba/git/trees/a41dc535a1a0f64f33041c93271146eb0a298bff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matheusBrqRocha/ko