martmull/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/martmull","id":29927851,"login":"martmull","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTI3ODUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/7381038452fd2e95c9f5913fd84fbfb1861c3e1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:07:11Z","email":"martmull@hotmail.fr","name":"martmull"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:07:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Paginate admin panel app registrations list (#22734)\n\n## Context\n\nThe `findAllApplicationRegistrations` query on the admin panel Apps page\n(`/settings/admin-panel#apps`) loaded every application registration at\nonce, with search and filtering done client-side.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Server**\n- `findAllApplicationRegistrations` now takes `limit` / `offset` /\n`searchTerm` / `isPreInstalledOnly` args and returns a\n`PaginatedApplicationRegistrations` object (`registrations`,\n`totalCount`, `hasMore`), following the same pattern as `getQueueJobs`.\n- `ApplicationRegistrationService.findAll` uses `findAndCount` with\n`take`/`skip`, and moves the search (name, source package, universal\nidentifier via `ILIKE`) and the pre-installed filter into the SQL query,\nmirroring how `getInstalledWorkspacesGlobal` filters installed\nworkspaces.\n\n**Frontend**\n- `SettingsAdminApps` passes the page, the debounced search term (300ms,\nlike the installed workspaces table), and the pre-installed toggle as\nquery variables instead of filtering client-side.\n- Adds a Previous / Next pagination footer (25 per page) matching the\nqueue jobs table, shown only when there is more than one page.\n- The \"unconfigured first\" ordering is kept within each page\n(`isConfigured` is a dataloader-resolved field, so it can''t be sorted in\nSQL).\n\n## Notes\n- Regenerated `generated-admin/graphql.ts` follows in a subsequent\ncommit.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_015erumgPozkbNA3zPeKrrFW)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22734?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Weiko <corentin@twenty.com>","tree":{"sha":"a235883b01b2aa67b76e185a7a2d75c01b26f20b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/trees/a235883b01b2aa67b76e185a7a2d75c01b26f20b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/commits/7381038452fd2e95c9f5913fd84fbfb1861c3e1d","verification":{"payload":"tree a235883b01b2aa67b76e185a7a2d75c01b26f20b\nparent b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4\nauthor martmull <martmull@hotmail.fr> 1783944431 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783944431 +0200\n\nPaginate admin panel app registrations list (#22734)\n\n## Context\n\nThe `findAllApplicationRegistrations` query on the admin panel Apps page\n(`/settings/admin-panel#apps`) loaded every application registration at\nonce, with search and filtering done client-side.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Server**\n- `findAllApplicationRegistrations` now takes `limit` / `offset` /\n`searchTerm` / `isPreInstalledOnly` args and returns a\n`PaginatedApplicationRegistrations` object (`registrations`,\n`totalCount`, `hasMore`), following the same pattern as `getQueueJobs`.\n- `ApplicationRegistrationService.findAll` uses `findAndCount` with\n`take`/`skip`, and moves the search (name, source package, universal\nidentifier via `ILIKE`) and the pre-installed filter into the SQL query,\nmirroring how `getInstalledWorkspacesGlobal` filters installed\nworkspaces.\n\n**Frontend**\n- `SettingsAdminApps` passes the page, the debounced search term (300ms,\nlike the installed workspaces table), and the pre-installed toggle as\nquery variables instead of filtering client-side.\n- Adds a Previous / Next pagination footer (25 per page) matching the\nqueue jobs table, shown only when there is more than one page.\n- The \"unconfigured first\" ordering is kept within each page\n(`isConfigured` is a dataloader-resolved field, so it can''t be sorted in\nSQL).\n\n## Notes\n- Regenerated `generated-admin/graphql.ts` follows in a subsequent\ncommit.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_015erumgPozkbNA3zPeKrrFW)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22734?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Weiko <corentin@twenty.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVNTvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/ioQAB/kI9Bs0oNLiFPaeqOS7FyB\nt+Uoc34aC+MrR0+m/tLy4cUK72by4ymiDNTWtTe50OheShxEmBASb3YbtFqARffT\nyOB1q/+KNUvxOqJaPs/JyywQp8IQoTuT0yWHRNDitQCEfBEbGv70PTOObJhOUNRP\nM+wrqnMQC4dYa5DtObldy6EYjA4DGE96UuoPc1M9dZ2J+/y0G9zWdN91xZFMvkTE\nBCw9xmGnxl7cww++9ih8tQOZs242odTmQ/AX2LvKNJKipVn+A/Sjpmx5TsBlKuN6\nvpXEAHT7CkgP73hr8O60YU6/eS340yRugDt6GKxa9HyuC6onLz3FhKS1dkdyO7xU\nNmcIyEpeBbGWMf+7W3oEvSjm7zzVxzT5bh064RyoXdF6w107agvxjv5jpaEpWFgJ\na8++0fb4ObYdNkyY3RMsvJ7OTM3iQQ3TDYlYCweLrWgCN8AVfRbbvsgtUitNVpr/\ndLiEpC4jCBNnkP5lvWzhVkwTfKtT/mjc4QFoHRGp3tyM6mE+i3Qak8s9FHH3na+a\n9SQYF7khTCLViANqo/q8Hjh12HzMm4grv2QdoEpbBSNmsYPiY5MKvNNfVN6sezul\nT3eEttQbT9hbkfuPjMwoEydfU3lPSKRyw8/xd4muc2ouzwL23ZOwY6ocwClRh9yE\ny0U5skANHpsuc9sLQhgo\n=oBKt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T19:14:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdmott/twenty/commit/7381038452fd2e95c9f5913fd84fbfb1861c3e1d","node_id":"C_kwDOTYmR0NoAKDczODEwMzg0NTJmZDJlOTVjOWY1OTEzZmQ4NGZiZmIxODYxYzNlMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdmott/twenty/commit/b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4","sha":"b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4"}],"sha":"7381038452fd2e95c9f5913fd84fbfb1861c3e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/7381038452fd2e95c9f5913fd84fbfb1861c3e1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:56:35Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:56:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(website): query isVetted so the apps marketplace renders again (#22859)\n\n## What\n\nProduction `/apps` renders no apps. The marketplace queries still\nrequest `isFeatured`, but #22674 renamed that flag to `isVetted` across\nthe server schema (2-20 instance command renames the DB column — same\nflag, same data, trust-signal semantics). Production (2.21) rejects the\nquery:\n\n```\nCannot query field \"isFeatured\" on type \"MarketplaceApp\"\n```\n\nThe transport throws on GraphQL errors, `fetchMarketplaceApps` catches\nand falls back to `[]`, so the page renders the empty state.\n`/apps/[slug]` detail pages degrade the same way.\n\n## Fix\n\nRename `isFeatured` -> `isVetted` across the website marketplace module:\nboth queries, the API response types, the `MarketplaceApp` domain type,\nand the vetted-first sort. 4 files, no behavior change beyond restoring\nthe data (same column, same values).\n\nThe catch-all `[]` fallback is intentionally left in place.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Corrected query run against `https://api.twenty.com/metadata`: returns\nthe 3 live apps (People Data Labs, Last contact, Call Recorder),\n`isVetted: true`.\n- Rename provenance confirmed: #22674 is a pure rename (paired diff,\nsymmetric column rename, `previousName: ''isFeatured''` marker on the\nentity).\n- `nx typecheck twenty-website` + `nx lint twenty-website` green.\n\nTakes effect on the next website deploy (`force-dynamic` route, 300s\nrevalidate).","tree":{"sha":"3e04a32dad503745ce367c3b97934e082ce1d783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/trees/3e04a32dad503745ce367c3b97934e082ce1d783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/commits/b06f3c7f8f2175bd769cc722ed8795770178f1d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e04a32dad503745ce367c3b97934e082ce1d783\nparent a6af7303539f2f81ce91dbf93f8da17aebdd7188\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1783943795 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783943795 +0200\n\nfix(website): query isVetted so the apps marketplace renders again (#22859)\n\n## What\n\nProduction `/apps` renders no apps. The marketplace queries still\nrequest `isFeatured`, but #22674 renamed that flag to `isVetted` across\nthe server schema (2-20 instance command renames the DB column — same\nflag, same data, trust-signal semantics). Production (2.21) rejects the\nquery:\n\n```\nCannot query field \"isFeatured\" on type \"MarketplaceApp\"\n```\n\nThe transport throws on GraphQL errors, `fetchMarketplaceApps` catches\nand falls back to `[]`, so the page renders the empty state.\n`/apps/[slug]` detail pages degrade the same way.\n\n## Fix\n\nRename `isFeatured` -> `isVetted` across the website marketplace module:\nboth queries, the API response types, the `MarketplaceApp` domain type,\nand the vetted-first sort. 4 files, no behavior change beyond restoring\nthe data (same column, same values).\n\nThe catch-all `[]` fallback is intentionally left in place.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Corrected query run against `https://api.twenty.com/metadata`: returns\nthe 3 live apps (People Data Labs, Last contact, Call Recorder),\n`isVetted: true`.\n- Rename provenance confirmed: #22674 is a pure rename (paired diff,\nsymmetric column rename, `previousName: ''isFeatured''` marker on the\nentity).\n- `nx typecheck twenty-website` + `nx lint twenty-website` green.\n\nTakes effect on the next website deploy (`force-dynamic` route, 300s\nrevalidate).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVNJzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKgAQAIDzXpFw5fhtDTPLfinfSbkE\nUhB5h3pcb54/Wq/LsJ+IlgY+LHHjfGoC6XLVrXkrVkfk+/rc3nyzsGBBumoM7ZPR\nq6sRLgzaOawcFzVx1+b0UbdntxAKNVDnkTyVSSlMq3HzXx2o5bbyRErTsKd2w3dY\nwq8fQ3TckbPjYlMB4kswriTUdwpxXrndUoiw4tuCcW8T2+zk/V2hLXtK0LpFedZO\nB9fV+iWRW0HlX5mKqEF4qRJv/oDgzyIAcfjGO7Pt3DvU7jdL2YM9vxjvtG2DtB3/\nUfIOSNLkHrvEH/EaAm/KUsmN1PvezUzjHXnCWoudCkAEJgqm9lmGZyaoc3kEOHWx\n7QQZMqJZtSrJ2hYpqCZhHGdbhYvkdiUhRSUYdGSi3WxJJv8U7bl+3FfNKnlOmZm5\nijzSDp05N0bsvl5012GToWtObvzJ8pLsnuzDzW8Ou3hUYIXTCYuv3LyYgrAq/LW4\nPG/zkMKWofTJG1f/RkIyEtV0OyKmvTfxSlzGGZU+VQwfp/vd8QX4YNSbGyntFJDu\nS9Vq67JxrKC7pt7H