ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdmott/twenty/commit/797acff5fab47eea6090e9eb56869d853f7b1cc5","node_id":"C_kwDOTYmR0NoAKDc5N2FjZmY1ZmFiNDdlZWE2MDkwZTllYjU2ODY5ZDg1M2Y3YjFjYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdmott/twenty/commit/c1b62334b75f60e7562a776d7da57f0d31c7cfd4","sha":"c1b62334b75f60e7562a776d7da57f0d31c7cfd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/c1b62334b75f60e7562a776d7da57f0d31c7cfd4"}],"sha":"797acff5fab47eea6090e9eb56869d853f7b1cc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/797acff5fab47eea6090e9eb56869d853f7b1cc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22936103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thomtrp","id":22936103,"login":"thomtrp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTM2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomtrp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/commits/c1b62334b75f60e7562a776d7da57f0d31c7cfd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:48:33Z","email":"thomas.trompette@sfr.fr","name":"Thomas Trompette"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:48:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workflow): scope one-active-per-workflow index to workspace (#22795)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe Phase 0 core index \\`IDX_WORKFLOW_VERSION_ONE_ACTIVE_PER_WORKFLOW\\`\nis on \\`(workflowId) WHERE status=''ACTIVE''\\`, with **no\n\\`workspaceId\\`**. But \\`core.workflowVersion\\` is a shared multi-tenant\ntable, so this enforces \"one active version per workflowId **globally\nacross all workspaces**\" instead of per workspace.\n\nThe version backfill fails on staging with:\n\\`\\`\\`\nduplicate key value violates unique constraint\n\"IDX_WORKFLOW_VERSION_ONE_ACTIVE_PER_WORKFLOW\"\nDetail: Key (\"workflowId\")=(8b213cac-...) already exists.\n\\`\\`\\`\nacross several different workspaces that share the same workflowId\n(seeded/cloned data): workspace A''s active version claims the\nworkflowId, and every other workspace''s insert collides. Every other\nindex on this table includes \\`workspaceId\\`; this one dropped it when\ncopied from the per-tenant workspace entity.\n\n## Fix\n\nIndex becomes \\`(workspaceId, workflowId) WHERE status=''ACTIVE''\\` — one\nactive version per workflow **per workspace**, matching the table''s\nmulti-tenant design and the intended invariant. New 2-20 fast instance\ncommand drops and recreates the index (Phase 0''s command is\nmerged/append-only).\n\n## Test\n\nReset + reproduce the exact scenario against the fixed index:\n- two workspaces with the same workflowId, both ACTIVE → **insert\nsucceeds** (previously collided)\n- a second ACTIVE version for the same workflow within one workspace →\n**still blocked** (invariant preserved)\n\nZero \\`migrate:generate\\` drift, typecheck + lint clean. After this\ndeploys, re-run \\`upgrade:2-20:backfill-workflow-version-to-core\\`.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22795?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"7829c2cc05373c4c20074f92b44f25fbff5397ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/trees/7829c2cc05373c4c20074f92b44f25fbff5397ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/commits/c1b62334b75f60e7562a776d7da57f0d31c7cfd4","verification":{"payload":"tree 7829c2cc05373c4c20074f92b44f25fbff5397ce\nparent dcb67fbbe152c21439a5067577f37c0aa7afe6fd\nauthor Thomas Trompette <thomas.trompette@sfr.fr> 1783687713 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783687713 +0000\n\nfix(workflow): scope one-active-per-workflow index to workspace (#22795)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe Phase 0 core index \\`IDX_WORKFLOW_VERSION_ONE_ACTIVE_PER_WORKFLOW\\`\nis on \\`(workflowId) WHERE status=''ACTIVE''\\`, with **no\n\\`workspaceId\\`**. But \\`core.workflowVersion\\` is a shared multi-tenant\ntable, so this enforces \"one active version per workflowId **globally\nacross all workspaces**\" instead of per workspace.\n\nThe version backfill fails on staging with:\n\\`\\`\\`\nduplicate key value violates unique constraint\n\"IDX_WORKFLOW_VERSION_ONE_ACTIVE_PER_WORKFLOW\"\nDetail: Key (\"workflowId\")=(8b213cac-...) already exists.\n\\`\\`\\`\nacross several different workspaces that share the same workflowId\n(seeded/cloned data): workspace A''s active version claims the\nworkflowId, and every other workspace''s insert collides. Every other\nindex on this table includes \\`workspaceId\\`; this one dropped it when\ncopied from the per-tenant workspace entity.\n\n## Fix\n\nIndex becomes \\`(workspaceId, workflowId) WHERE status=''ACTIVE''\\` — one\nactive version per workflow **per workspace**, matching the table''s\nmulti-tenant design and the intended invariant. New 2-20 fast instance\ncommand drops and recreates the index (Phase 0''s command is\nmerged/append-only).\n\n## Test\n\nReset + reproduce the exact scenario against the fixed index:\n- two workspaces with the same workflowId, both ACTIVE → **insert\nsucceeds** (previously collided)\n- a second ACTIVE version for the same workflow within one workspace →\n**still blocked** (invariant preserved)\n\nZero \\`migrate:generate\\` drift, typecheck + lint clean. After this\ndeploys, re-run \\`upgrade:2-20:backfill-workflow-version-to-core\\`.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22795?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUOohCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIjMQAEqNbMJwbyLdazigm6S+qFnJ\n3k7vz9VSroWGUaEq1PweYwtzw0VCk4mVWa+yE/qJZ9qoiAEYA1P7oJS+YdA0cmZd\n3LboavWn0wilt5uDvzVdFObR38lW6b5cu76lR4e8yuwCCstM+K0ZO9wUpyClVcT5\nRFFwEoEyWq5CnmCKuZ8UCEZrbThlHtUNDyfOZHhmCku/vLrFOyRlsEmiVk1FTQ5c\nR0JKQM2kdP8W49S3kP17yHAAEH7gGGhacXjO6yJRS7Yid+V0YnX1h7wtBp5+T9Ps\n4RwhPyuvArZxtOvbrcc1xY4K7GTBJ5pgkt7Ep9OM9LZo2f/tRbOtgkQE1qNCpdot\nawpXmbCM+W62H/V/OHmLrK4Dhrw1cIJ8C1NSps/7BM8i6hoYY4VpILGg2sv++i8m\neHWTIV8JyAsvSpyQ9xC9gQOkdLsO4WdwpU7t/JHLV3YsA8oW4ecfl22nX1J36W2D\nr3h9SzaXT47GPSCPPHFqvZPMK7u0MD7ktTm8jCuUu/mjKmZ1Gqmjf8Yi3INZJtR8\nvqtpG1WtgDNNHr+gs9LRvtyuRuAC8XpFhXb7ldJ+qsggpW67rZeYSjtWb7VTEMVR\nW4eefiysxEXb/frmvdNbz7d4eQhZ5BqOuYUDKG1H6a5Qdj5tMhIELOS54ilfRBi