space` core modules off\n`@ptc-org/nestjs-query`. Both used `NestjsQueryGraphQLModule` only as\nscaffolding — all CRUD was disabled and the real GraphQL API is already\nserved by the hand-written `UserResolver` / `WorkspaceResolver`.\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22766?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Weiko <corentin@twenty.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce4776d47a86d20e1424594575fad61df626dfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/trees/ce4776d47a86d20e1424594575fad61df626dfb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdmott/twenty/git/commits/d23511ea5e5af2987b3fff60c343b27e4f353443","verification":{"payload":"tree ce4776d47a86d20e1424594575fad61df626dfb3\nparent ace16add6c086351c5d4909efd7cc403a551a272\nauthor Abdul Rahman <81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com> 1783682998 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783682998 +0530\n\nremove nestjs-query from user and workspace resolvers (#22766)\n\n## What\n\nMigrates the `user` and `workspace` core modules off\n`@ptc-org/nestjs-query`. Both used `NestjsQueryGraphQLModule` only as\nscaffolding — all CRUD was disabled and the real GraphQL API is already\nserved by the hand-written `UserResolver` / `WorkspaceResolver`.\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22766?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-ima