s/4c2894d1023544c3053f39fcb69f45b5d2b059b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T06:25:21Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T06:25:21Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Credit : exclut les DAT du selecteur de decaissement (dette temporaire)\n\nAucun mecanisme de blocage jusqu''a echeance n''existe dans le module\nEpargne (pas de maturity_date, retirer() ne distingue pas les types) :\ncrediter un decaissement sur un DAT n''a pas de sens metier, le client\nne pourrait pas en disposer librement. Exclusion PAR TYPE, pas un vrai\ncontrole de disponibilite - a remplacer le jour ou le blocage DAT\nexistera (voir docs/conformite-comptable.md cote backend).","tree":{"sha":"61871fec7d89203235c4edede6c42e86905983a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/61871fec7d89203235c4edede6c42e86905983a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/4c2894d1023544c3053f39fcb69f45b5d2b059b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/4c2894d1023544c3053f39fcb69f45b5d2b059b4","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDRjMjg5NGQxMDIzNTQ0YzMwNTNmMzlmY2I2OWY0NWI1ZDJiMDU5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/ad229a6ff03df6d648257ef31430f9a2aa492d07","sha":"ad229a6ff03df6d648257ef31430f9a2aa492d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/ad229a6ff03df6d648257ef31430f9a2aa492d07"}],"sha":"4c2894d1023544c3053f39fcb69f45b5d2b059b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/4c2894d1023544c3053f39fcb69f45b5d2b059b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/ad229a6ff03df6d648257ef31430f9a2aa492d07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T05:02:16Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T05:02:16Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Credit : decaissement multi-mode - caisse ou compte du tiers\n\nSur le dossier approuve, le responsable choisit au moment du\ndecaissement : especes a la caisse (inchange), ou credit direct sur un\ncompte du tiers deja ouvert, quel qu''en soit le produit (EAV/DAT/EPR...).\nLe selecteur liste tous les comptes ACTIFS du tiers avec numero/produit/\nsolde et disparait s''il n''y en a aucun ; le texte de confirmation\ns''adapte au mode choisi ; le mouvement ''decaissement_credit'' est\nidentifiable dans l''historique du compte credite.","tree":{"sha":"475909b53427dd5e756d39800e24af7679a55ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/475909b53427dd5e756d39800e24af7679a55ce1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/ad229a6ff03df6d648257ef31430f9a2aa492d07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public