e l''echeancier avant decaissement\n\nVisible des l''approbation, avant tout decaissement : montants\nGARANTIS identiques a l''echeancier reel, dates INDICATIVES (calculees\ncomme si le decaissement avait lieu aujourd''hui) — bandeau explicite\nsur la distinction. Bouton Imprimer via window.print() sur une zone\ndediee (.zone-impression, voir index.css) qui masque tout le reste de\nla page : n''atterrissent sur le papier que l''identite du tiers, le\nmontant, le produit, le bandeau, le tableau et une ligne de signature\nclient + date.","tree":{"sha":"5e0f5b5a52fd95ab0b319d52fcef5804aeea877a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/5e0f5b5a52fd95ab0b319d52fcef5804aeea877a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/e1dfdd52af402427c124b38e0e29464b6baae62b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/e1dfdd52af402427c124b38e0e29464b6baae62b","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKGUxZGZkZDUyYWY0MDI0MjdjMTI0YjM4ZTBlMjk0NjRiNmJhYWU2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17","sha":"f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17"}],"sha":"e1dfdd52af402427c124b38e0e29464b6baae62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/e1dfdd52af402427c124b38e0e29464b6baae62b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T04:50:38Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T04:50:38Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"CR6b credit : ecrans decaissement + echeancier\n\nDecaissement reserve au responsable d''agence (credit.decaissement.create,\nseparation des taches), confirmation en deux temps qui enonce montant,\ncompte et duree avant le clic. Echeancier persiste affiche apres\ndecaissement et reste visible a chaque revisite du dossier.","tree":{"sha":"c897692fdd31222e596cef3d38c3dffd840d78f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/c897692fdd31222e596cef3d38c3dffd840d78f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKGY4NDVkZWIwYmQ3NTU0NjM1Y2E5YzBjN2Y2ODIwYjY4MWZkM2RhMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523","sha":"45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523"}],"sha":"f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/f845deb0bd7554635ca9c0c7f6820b681fd3da17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:23:26Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:23:26Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"CR6a credit : ecrans demande + decision\n\nActive enfin le menu \"Credit\" (etait \"a_venir\" depuis le debut). Trois\nmorceaux, sur le meme patron qu''Epargne/Parts :\n\n- Onglet \"Credit\" sur la fiche tiers : historique des dossiers DE CE TIERS\n  (via GET /tiers/{id}/demandes-credit, cloisonne cote serveur) + creation\n  d''une demande, gate KYC explique (jamais un bouton absent sans dire\n  pourquoi), reserve credit.demande.create.\n- Page liste (/credit) : tous les dossiers du perimetre, filtrables par\n  statut, chaque ligne menant au dossier.\n- Vue detail d''un dossier (/credit/:id) : infos + bloc decision (approuver\n  avec montant plafonne au demande, ou refuser), motif obligatoire dans les\n  deux sens, reserve credit.demande.decide. La structure accueille deja le\n  statut ''decaisse'' sans casser, prete pour CR6b.\n\nformatFcfa reutilise depuis l''Epargne (pas reduplique, contrairement a la\ndette deja notee cote Parts).\n\n26 tests neufs, suite complete verte, tsc/eslint propres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af28af2d1b19cfc54843baa8adc0ebf95ca6cd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/af28af2d1b19cfc54843baa8adc0ebf95ca6cd50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDQ1ZmRkZmRmYjNkYzdkMTc1MTU1MWY4YmQ4OWIzNGIxZTg4YjQ1MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93","sha":"2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93"}],"sha":"45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/45fddfdfb3dc7d1751551f8bd89b34b1e88b4523"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:19:19Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:19:19Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Cohérence caisse/parts — retire les numéros de compte figés des libellés\n\n« Compte des parts libérées (57111) » / « ... non libérées (57112) » :\nle numéro entre parenthèses était en dur dans le libellé du CHAMP, distinct\nde la valeur affichée (déjà dynamique). Depuis le rerouting vers les\ncomptes d''extension à 6 chiffres (571111/571121, backend), ce numéro figé\nmentait — retiré, la valeur réelle reste visible juste à côté.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94f2d99c75ed93e4281179a6860329e52716db87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/94f2d99c75ed93e4281179a6860329e52716db87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDI1MzZjMWQxZmFmYTk0MDhhZWM5NjNkYTdiZGJmNGQ4Y2UwNWNjOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942","sha":"aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942"}],"sha":"2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2536c1d1fafa9408aec963da7bdbf4d8ce05cc93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:08:36Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:08:36Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Comptabilité — écrans Grand livre et Balance (R1/R2)\n\nGrand livre : sélecteur de compte DÉDIÉ (comptes désactivés inclus, leur\nhistorique reste consultable), filtre de dates, tableau avec solde cumulé,\npagination. Un compte désactivé se signale dans le menu déroulant ET dans\nl''en-tête du résultat une fois choisi (pas seulement au moment de la\nsélection). Tant qu''aucun compte n''est choisi, un texte d''invite explicite —\njamais un silence qui pourrait sembler cassé.\n\nBalance : bandeau d''équilibre reprenant le même langage visuel que le\nrapprochement épargne (vert « équilibrée » / rouge « déséquilibrée » —\nl''invariant de la partie double le garantit presque toujours, mais c''est\ncette familiarité qui le rend rassurant d''un coup d''œil), totaux débit/\ncrédit, filtre de dates + case « inclure les comptes sans mouvement ».\n\nNavigation : remplace le placeholder « Comptabilité générale » (à venir) par\nles deux entrées actives, réservées à compta.rapport.read — pas de nouveau\nsous-menu, le menu n''a jamais eu de niveau imbriqué.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51ba78881de86704e52f9db2357d06e673ec7d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/51ba78881de86704e52f9db2357d06e673ec7d9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKGFlZWYzZDc2OTI1YjQyMDU5NzE5YmQwMmU3OWFmMjJkMzEwNTY5NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/23829ef45b644a6b3612a46712b53a923e20d70f","sha":"23829ef45b644a6b3612a46712b53a923e20d70f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/23829ef45b644a6b3612a46712b53a923e20d70f"}],"sha":"aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/aeef3d76925b42059719bd02e79af22d31056942"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/23829ef45b644a6b3612a46712b53a923e20d70f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T01:21:01Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T01:21:01Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Paramétrage comptable, Bloc 5 — écrans de rattachement : produits, caisse, parts\n\nTrois écrans sous le menu Comptabilité (rangés avec le reste du chantier) :\nrattachements épargne (3 sélecteurs par produit), caisse par agence (1 par\nagence), paramètres des parts sociales (formulaire unique). Bandeau fixe sur\nles trois : « ce changement s''applique aux prochaines opérations, jamais aux\nécritures déjà passées ». Sélecteurs de compte alimentés par le nouvel\nendpoint filtré côté serveur — le vrai garde-fou reste côté API à l''écriture.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5c170fcdc2ae5b806c092d916dc006e44e9fc81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/d5c170fcdc2ae5b806c092d916dc006e44e9fc81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/23829ef45b644a6b3612a46712b53a923e20d70f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: