recherche/filtre classe/désactivés,\ncréation inline, fiche avec modification du libellé, changement de sens et désactivation\n(motif obligatoire, bouton bloqué sous 3 caractères). Menu « Plan de comptes » sous\nComptabilité.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5cba9252b6cb848d584337d7d8dd12f9e052e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/b5cba9252b6cb848d584337d7d8dd12f9e052e05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/11ddc432873db3324faf5ad06ea6eca45601b389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/11ddc432873db3324faf5ad06ea6eca45601b389","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDExZGRjNDMyODczZGIzMzI0ZmFmNWFkMDZlYTZlY2E0NTYwMWIzODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4","sha":"8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4"}],"sha":"11ddc432873db3324faf5ad06ea6eca45601b389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/11ddc432873db3324faf5ad06ea6eca45601b389"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:52:44Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T23:52:44Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Guichet des parts sociales — encaissement caissier (comptant + libération)\n\nUn seul écran /guichet à deux onglets (Épargne / Parts sociales), un seul poste de\ntravail pour le caissier, pas de navigation entre deux écrans pendant qu''un client\nattend. Chaque onglet reste INDÉPENDANT en interne : l''épargne se cherche par\nnuméro de compte, les parts par identité du tiers (numéro ou nom) — pas de fusion\nforcée entre deux clés naturellement différentes.\n\n- OngletGuichetEpargne.tsx : l''ancien PageGuichet.tsx extrait TEL QUEL (écran déjà\n  validé au navigateur, zéro régression).\n- OngletGuichetParts.tsx : nouveau — recherche (réutilise GET /tiers?q=), nom\n  proéminent avant toute opération, gate KYC (tiers actif), confirmation qui\n  RÉPÈTE le nom et le montant (même règle que le guichet épargne).\n- PageGuichet.tsx : le shell à onglets, chacun visible selon l''usage\n  (epargne.operation.deposit / tiers.shares.pay).\n\nComble un vrai trou : « Souscrire au comptant » (nouveau sociétaire qui paie cash,\nadhésion en UNE visite) est désormais accessible au caissier — jusqu''ici aucune UI\nn''existait pour cet acte pourtant couvert par tiers.shares.pay (l''onglet Parts de\nla fiche est caché au caissier, qui n''a que tiers.read.basic). « Libérer des\nparts » n''apparaît que s''il y a des parts non libérées. Aucun nouvel endpoint\nbackend : chargerParts/souscrireComptant/libererParts et la recherche existaient\ndéjà.\n\nRoutePermission et menuVisible acceptent désormais un tableau de permissions\n(ANY-OF) — le guichet est accessible dès qu''on a l''un des deux droits, l''onglet\ncorrespondant à l''autre étant simplement absent. Changement générique, réutilisable.\n\n143 tests frontend verts (+14 dédiés : shell à onglets, gating any-of, recherche,\ngate KYC, comptant avec bascule Client -> Membre, libération, refus serveur en\nlangage humain). tsc, eslint, build production clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"698163d37e065426ab8a55b46bbabaec5eae4d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/698163d37e065426ab8a55b46bbabaec5eae4d58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDgwMzcxODBiODIwZWIxNDgwYWNiM2U2MDc4NjZmMDRkYTkzZjRhZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/785f7875bc266f5923f50ed83cabeea364d14df0","sha":"785f7875bc266f5923f50ed83cabeea364d14df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/785f7875bc266f5923f50ed83cabeea364d14df0"}],"sha":"8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/8037180b820eb1480acb3e607866f04da93f4ae4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/785f7875bc266f5923f50ed83cabeea364d14df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T13:01:27Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T13:01:27Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Désactivation : blocages affichés AVANT, bouton Confirmer absent si engagements\n\nLe panneau « Désactiver » charge désormais les engagements À L''OUVERTURE\n(GET /tiers/{id}/deactivation-engagements). S''il y en a : titre « Désactivation\nimpossible pour l''instant », liste actionnable (capital des parts en francs, solde\ndu compte d''épargne, quoi faire), et AUCUN bouton Confirmer — on ne montre pas un\nbouton qui va échouer (même règle que l''activation KYC). Le bouton revient quand il\nn''y a plus d''engagement. Pendant la vérification, bouton absent aussi.\n\nAu passage : le 422 « engagements ouverts » était confondu côté front avec le détail\nstructuré du doublon de pièce (même forme {message,...}) — plus de chemin d''erreur\ntardif, le blocage est connu avant le clic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee476c9a224ff2c58bbc552fe3d6e1e889f0cce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/ee476c9a224ff2c58bbc552fe3d6e1e889f0cce5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus