ing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/289e4b82710599b65a6e6e300d3545ef49f3002b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:35:29Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:35:29Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Tiers PS0 — badge sociétariat Membre/Client (fiche + liste)\n\nAffiche le marqueur is_member : badge « Membre » en bleu institutionnel (brand,\njamais utilisé par les tons de statut -> pas de confusion avec Actif/Suspendu) ou\n« Client » en neutre. Sur la fiche, empilé sous le badge de statut (deux dimensions\ndistinctes qui se lisent sans confusion) ; dans la liste, une colonne « Sociétariat »\ndédiée. Lecture seule (tiers.read).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac6d5ded5b12579b0c415219ca42393e0f9de5e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/ac6d5ded5b12579b0c415219ca42393e0f9de5e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/289e4b82710599b65a6e6e300d3545ef49f3002b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/289e4b82710599b65a6e6e300d3545ef49f3002b","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDI4OWU0YjgyNzEwNTk5YjY1YTZlNmUzMDBkMzU0NWVmNDlmMzAwMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5","sha":"182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5"}],"sha":"289e4b82710599b65a6e6e300d3545ef49f3002b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/289e4b82710599b65a6e6e300d3545ef49f3002b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:22:15Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:22:15Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Épargne F4 — écrans versement des intérêts + rapprochement (contrôle)\n\nVersement (réservé direction, /epargne/interets) : période + dates -> PRÉVISUALISER\n-> total « X comptes, total à verser : Y F » + bandeau PROVISOIRE + table de détail\n(taux, méthode, base, montant par compte) -> confirmation RENFORCÉE (on crée de\nl''argent) -> rapport. Anti-double dit clairement « déjà versés le [date] ».\n\nÉcran jamais muet après un clic : bouton toujours actif (message si saisie\nincomplète), et « rien à verser » affiche la RAISON (taux 0 / aucun compte /\nsoldes insuffisants) via les compteurs de diagnostic de l''aperçu.\n\nRapprochement (contrôle, /epargne/rapprochement) : table par compte collectif,\nauxiliaire vs général, Concordant (vert) / Écart : X F (rouge) + bandeau de synthèse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e59353b9e9a4c46d4bf2d2d96f9e9155af919a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/e59353b9e9a4c46d4bf2d2d96f9e9155af919a0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDE4MjUxMjcyMGNlZTQ5M2Y2NTZiODI2YWZhYThlOTZlYjlkZTlmYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780","sha":"965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780"}],"sha":"182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/182512720cee493f656b826afaa8e96eb9de9fb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:11:48Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:11:48Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Corrige la fuite de cache entre sessions à la déconnexion (poste partagé)\n\nÀ la déconnexion, on vide tout le cache react-query (queryClient.clear()) après\navoir fermé la session, avant de rediriger. Sans ça, le profil — donc les\npermissions — et les données d''une session survivaient au changement de compte :\nsur un poste partagé (agent de guichet, caisse), l''utilisateur suivant pouvait\nvoir fugitivement des entrées/boutons d''un rôle qui n''est pas le sien. Le serveur\nrefusait de toute façon toute action, mais l''écran ne doit pas mentir : sessions\nnon mêlées.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"322d505247d761d59c5a1209455437d172b86a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/322d505247d761d59c5a1209455437d172b86a16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDk2NTU3NTI4M2I0Y2Y3Mjg4YTFhYWFjY2Y4ZDE2YzY2ZmU4MDg3ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b","sha":"2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b"}],"sha":"965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/965575283b4cf7288a1aaaccf8d16c66fe808780"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:10:20Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T21:10:20Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Épargne F3 — fermeture de compte dans l''onglet + boucle désactivation lisible\n\nChaque compte se déplie en panneau : relevé des mouvements (date · type · pièce ·\nmontant signé) + action « Fermer le compte » (responsable), avec la RESTITUTION\naffichée avant de confirmer (« Le solde de X F sera restitué au membre ») — on ne\nferme pas à l''aveugle. Quand plus aucun compte n''est ouvert, on DIT que le membre\nredevient désactivable : la boucle Épargne↔Tiers rendue visible à l''écran.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e60028b9f0744ab7d8cfb558d2a4e74eb9f02c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/9e60028b9f0744ab7d8cfb558d2a4e74eb9f02c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDJlZDgyNjRiYjI2MmU0MTdlMTQ1NmIyNzk3NjNkYTVlMzZkNzg2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706","sha":"9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706"}],"sha":"2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/2ed8264bb262e417e1456b279763da5e36d7862b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:53:58Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:53:58Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Épargne F2 — écran Guichet (dépôt / retrait)\n\nPage Guichet (route /guichet, entrée menu « Guichet épargne » gardée par\nepargne.operation.deposit) : le poste de travail du caissier.\n- Recherche par NUMÉRO de livret (chemin rapide du terrain) -> le TITULAIRE\n  s''affiche en gros (vérification humaine contre une faute de frappe du numéro).\n- Dépôt / Retrait : montant en francs, CONFIRMATION obligatoire qui RÉPÈTE le nom\n  du titulaire, bouton désactivé pendant l''envoi (pas de double-clic).\n- Succès avec n° de pièce + nouveau solde ; refus serveur affiché tel quel\n  (message métier) ; compte fermé -> aucune opération proposée.\nRéutilise l''identité bleue, les badges et formatFcfa. Build+lint OK, tests verts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1d06269f4b87456627a8cd3e2031c0ce9cd783a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/a1d06269f4b87456627a8cd3e2031c0ce9cd783a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDljZjlkMGZlYmUzZjNkMGYwMThkZDNiNzg1YTk0YjY5YWYwNWM3MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a","sha":"1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a"}],"sha":"9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9cf9d0febe3f3d0f018dd3b785a94b69af05c706"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:23:54Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T04:23:54Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"Épargne F1 — onglet « Comptes d''épargne » + ouverture\n\nPremier écran du module épargne, branché sur la fiche membre (PageFicheTier).\n- Onglet « Comptes d''épargne » : liste des comptes (numéro, produit, solde en\n  francs clair via formatFcfa, badge ouvert=vert / fermé=gris, badge provisoire\n  sur le produit).\n- Ouverture : bouton visible seulement pour epargne.account.open ET membre\n  actif ; sinon le gate KYC est EXPLIQUÉ à l''écran (« ce membre doit être\n  activé… un prospect n''y a pas droit »), comme le gate d''activation. Refus\n  serveur (422) affiché tel quel.\n- src/features/epargne/{api,badges,OngletComptesEpargne}.tsx + libellés.\n  Réutilise l''identité bleue et les badges existants. Build+lint OK, tests verts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"523985c18782ffee581d3f93a3699547344d512c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/523985c18782ffee581d3f93a3699547344d512c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDE5NDZiMGVhMzZmN2ZlZDYxZGRlNTYzMWE3ZDVkZjMwOTEzMzBmNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020","sha":"9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020"}],"sha":"1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/1946b0ea36f7fed61dde5631a7d5df3091330f5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:20:25Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T18:20:25Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"feat(ui): étend l''identité bleu institutionnel à tout le produit (menu, en-tête, Sécurité, auth)\n\nLe module Tiers était en bleu ; le reste restait en noir/blanc générique. Tout\nunifié via les MÊMES tokens et composants partagés (aucune couleur en dur, aucune\nrecopie).\n\n- Nom UNIFIÉ : profil.nomAffiche passe à « Nom Prénom » (last+first), même ordre\n  que le module Tiers -> fini « Ramatou Dodo » (en-tête) vs « Dodo Ramatou »\n  (Tiers). Le compte de test aicha reste à corriger en base (donnée inversée).\n- Menu (BarreLaterale) : entrée active en bleu institutionnel (barre + fond léger\n  + texte primary).\n- En-tête (AppLayout) : marque bleue + avatar de l''utilisateur connecté + liseré\n  haut bleu.\n- Sécurité : liste (avatars + BadgeStatutUtilisateur réutilisant le Badge unique +\n  recherche/loupe + bouton bleu) ; fiche (en-tête avatar + badge, nom unifié) ;\n  Confirmation + MotDePasseProvisoire -> tokens warning ; journal d''audit -> bouton\n  dépliant au lieu du lien souligné.\n- Auth : connexion (marque bleue) ; mot de passe (règle satisfaite -> token success).\n\nRien de fonctionnel ne change. TypeScript strict, 106 tests, lint/build OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d9577a902f67a24ca52e82f8149ca7f0b8fc73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/2d9577a902f67a24ca52e82f8149ca7f0b8fc73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDlmOGQ2NjYzMDNmNWIzOWI4NTI3YjA5NTVhOWU1NmIxZDMwOTgwMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73","sha":"46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73"}],"sha":"9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/9f8d666303f5b39b8527b0955a9e56b1d3098020"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T17:30:36Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T17:30:36Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"feat(tiers): T3c frontend (onglet KYC, bandeau réel) + refonte visuelle du module\n\nLivrés ensemble (mêmes fichiers) : le frontend T3c et l''habillage bleu institutionnel.\n\nT3c frontend :\n- OngletKyc : saisie origine des fonds / secteur / mode / PPE -> PATCH kyc,\n  recalcul, badge de niveau de risque + avertissement barème PROVISOIRE.\n- BandeauProspect : l''état réel (GET activation-conditions), liste ce qui reste\n  à compléter avant le clic « Activer » ; fini le « module à venir » figé.\n- clients api kyc.ts + référentiel secteurs ; FicheTier expose risk_level.\n\nRefonte visuelle (identité institutionnelle centralisée dans les tokens) :\n- bleu #185FA5 = --primary (bouton, liens/onglets actifs, en-têtes, carte de\n  type sélectionnée) ; accents #E6F1FB ; surfaces sobres. Zéro couleur en dur.\n- système de badges UNIQUE (components/ui/badge.tsx) + table de correspondance\n  métier (features/tiers/badges.tsx) : statut / risque / validité / principal /\n  vérifiée. Pastille + texte (couleur jamais seule = accessible).\n- avatars à initiales (bleu clair), recherche avec loupe, boutons-icônes au lieu\n  des liens soulignés (poubelle/étoile/+/coche), icônes devant les données.\n- fiche en deux colonnes ; frise avec icône + point coloré par nature d''événement.\n- bug corrigé : libellé « restored » -> « Réactivation ».\n\nRien de fonctionnel ne change. TypeScript strict, 106 tests, lint/build OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e25a6707e1da6b5d26052b0b4cc76c86db94234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/9e25a6707e1da6b5d26052b0b4cc76c86db94234"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73","node_id":"C_kwDOTYrAi9oAKDQ2YjBiZjljNzFmNzA4MjYyNjc2ZGEyYzU2YzY0MDJmMWMxNDhkNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commit/0be3543bf2c2f61eececb1cf1a686a5dd90f9767","sha":"0be3543bf2c2f61eececb1cf1a686a5dd90f9767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/0be3543bf2c2f61eececb1cf1a686a5dd90f9767"}],"sha":"46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/46b0bf9c71f708262676da2c56c6402f1c148d73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26196103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/netmophus","id":26196103,"login":"netmophus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTk2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netmophus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/commits/0be3543bf2c2f61eececb1cf1a686a5dd90f9767/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:19:01Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:19:01Z","email":"mlkane8383@gmail.com","name":"KANE Mahaman Lawan"},"message":"feat(tiers): onglets Coordonnées/Pièces (T2d) et écran de restauration des désactivés\n\nT2d — onglets sur la fiche :\n- OngletCoordonnees : téléphones/emails/adresses ; échappatoire du forçage\n  téléphone (« Enregistrer quand même » seulement si le backend dit\n  forcable=true) ; adresse rue ET point de repère d''égale importance ;\n- OngletPieces : badges de validité (valide/expire bientôt/périmée), bouton\n  Vérifier réservé à tiers.identity.verify, doublon nommé -> lien vers la fiche ;\n- clients API coordonnees.ts / pieces.ts.\n\nRestauration des désactivés (R3) — le chemin visible, pas seulement l''API :\n- liste : case « Afficher les fiches désactivées » (visible si\n  tiers.read.deleted), pilote inclure_desactives ;\n- fiche : bandeau « Fiche désactivée » ;\n- action « Réactiver la fiche » (si tiers.deactivate) avec confirmation\n  explicite : retour en PROSPECT, à re-valider (KYC), pas actif ;\n- collision de pièce à la restauration -> lien vers la fiche en conflit\n  (EchecTransition gagne un cas ''doublon'').\n\n103 tests verts, tsc/lint/build OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44376972d3d126b31adb19a525f2a3be794321e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/trees/44376972d3d126b31adb19a525f2a3be794321e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netmophus/microfin-frontend/git/commits/0be3543bf2