om/users/bryanjack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryanjack","id":15074842,"login":"bryanjack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc0ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryanjack/buildpro/commits/cbd479af28e875e999cc93c611cf3aadd8c54898/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:57:01Z","email":"bryanjack99@gmail.com","name":"BryanJack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:57:01Z","email":"bryanjack99@gmail.com","name":"BryanJack"},"message":"fix(ci): perbaiki npm ci web di npm 12 (lock overrides + allow-remote)\n\nnpm 12 (node:24 CI/Docker terbaru) memecah `npm ci` di paket web via dua\nperubahan perilaku, keduanya melempar EUSAGE + dump help `npm ci`:\n\n1. Validasi lock ketat: overrides @emnapi/core & @emnapi/runtime (pin 1.11.2)\n   tak pernah termaterialisasi di package-lock.json (masih 1.11.1) → \"Missing\n   @emnapi/core@1.11.2 from lock file\". Regenerasi lock dgn npm 12 memunculkan\n   node resolved 1.11.2 (hanya subtree emnapi/wasm yang berubah).\n2. Fetch source \"remote\" default-deny → @ospro/design-tokens (tarball GitHub)\n   ditolak. Tambah web/.npmrc `allow-remote=all` (integrity sudah dipin di\n   lock) + COPY .npmrc ke build stage Dockerfile.\n\nVerifikasi: npm@12 `npm ci` (jalur Docker+CI) sukses, design-tokens terpasang;\nnpm 11.6.2 lokal + typecheck tetap hijau; lock server/shared tak terpengaruh.","tree":{"sha":"204f1a452816536b23462b7a0ce8f59b6532ef15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryanjack/buildpro/git/trees/204f1a452816536b23462b7a0ce8f59b6532ef15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryanjack/buildpro/git/commits/cbd479af28e875e999cc93c611cf3aadd8c54898","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15074842?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bryanjack","id":15074842,"login":"bryanjack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDc0ODQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bryanjack","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bryanjack/buildpro/commit/cbd479af28e875e999cc93c611cf3aadd8c54898","node_id":"C_kwDOTYwogNoAKGNiZDQ3OWFmMjhlODc1ZTk5OWNjOTNjNjExY2YzYWFkZDhjNTQ4OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bryanjack/buildpro/commit/7a2d50363b7550e65448e05077de2a999a52e575","sha":"7a2d50363b7550e65448e05077de2a999a52e575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryanjack/buildpro/commits/7a2d50363b7550e65448e05077de2a999a52e575"}],"sha":"cbd479af28e875e999cc93c611cf3aadd8c54898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bryanjack/buildpro/commits/cbd479af28e875e999cc93c611cf3aadd8c54898"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github