IO\n- Frontend legacy: vanilla HTML/JS (frontend/)\n- Frontend React: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind v4 (frontend_react/)\n- Docker: docker-compose with nginx serving React SPA + backend + host Postgres\n- Tests: Jest + Supertest for backend routes (53 tests, ~63% coverage on thietbi.js)\n\nModules ported to React so far:\n- Login + auth context\n- Dashboard (KPI, charts, top-lists)\n- Thiết bị (full CRUD + parent-child expand + detail modal + Excel import + Calendar)\n- Vật tư (list + filters + KPI)\n- Bảo trì (list + partners)\n- Stubs: Phẫu thuật, Bản đồ, QR, Sinh mã, Cài đặt","tree":{"sha":"855781e087579433a6d7226e93b8e2cce6dbb2f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lee-hust/biomedical_erp_project/git/trees/855781e087579433a6d7226e93b8e2cce6dbb2f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lee-hust/biomedical_erp_project/git/commits/fde4e4777a19bae7c261189b47141fa2adf14144","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122813365?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-hust","id":122813365,"login":"jack-hust","node_id":"U_kgDOB1H7tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-hust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lee-hust/biomed