rvedAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:38.017Z","repositoryId":1301235541,"sha":"0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"Robertcl795","providerType":"User"},"email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-15T14:58:20Z","committedDate":"2026-07-15T14:58:20Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Robertcl795","providerType":"User"},"email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:38.017Z","repositoryId":1301235541,"sha":"b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"Robertcl795","providerType":"User"},"email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-15T06:01:08Z","committedDate":"2026-07-15T06:01:08Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Robertcl795","providerType":"User"},"email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:38.017Z","repositoryId":1301235541,"sha":"c7fe680892784a8cd4384f6669aee3dfc1a9d334"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:38.017Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/a5d3e55cf2448022c1e864e5df90c1f54d77c86f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:35:28Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:35:28Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"message":"refactor: group members into platform/ and demo/ at the root\n\nRenamed the workspace to MFEs-Platform-POC and replaced the single\ncheckoutDir with two group directories at the repo root.\n\n`repos/` was a level that separated nothing from nothing. The grouping now\ncarries the information instead: `platform/` is what other teams consume\n(contract, tooling, templates) and `demo/` is what gets demonstrated (the\nhost shell and its remotes).\n\nup-ui-shell is grouped under demo/ despite the up-ui- prefix. It is the\napplication being shown, not something another team installs.\n\nws.mjs now resolves each member through its group, validates the group\nagainst the manifest and exits 1 on an unknown one, and reports status and\ndoctor per group. The gitignore patterns are root-anchored (/platform/,\n/demo/) so they cannot swallow a demo/ directory inside legacy/.\n\nThe GitHub remote is deliberately still named MFEs-Mission-Control:\nrenaming a shared remote breaks origin for every existing clone. README\nand the workspace guide document the mismatch and how to clone around it.","tree":{"sha":"688cc1c9d63edc3b6adfb4b17bbe766aacc835a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/688cc1c9d63edc3b6adfb4b17bbe766aacc835a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/a5d3e55cf2448022c1e864e5df90c1f54d77c86f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/a5d3e55cf2448022c1e864e5df90c1f54d77c86f","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGE1ZDNlNTVjZjI0NDgwMjJjMWU4NjRlNWRmOTBjMWY1NGQ3N2M4NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617","sha":"35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617"}],"sha":"a5d3e55cf2448022c1e864e5df90c1f54d77c86f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/a5d3e55cf2448022c1e864e5df90c1f54d77c86f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:51:47Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:51:47Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"message":"refactor: convert Mission Control into a polyrepo workspace\n\nThis repo was a pnpm monorepo holding four apps and a bridge package. The\nwork moved out to independently owned repos months ago, which left this\none holding a stale copy of everything. It is now the umbrella instead:\na manifest of eleven member repos plus an orchestrator, and no source of\nits own. The original POC moves to `legacy/` with history preserved\n(`git mv`, 105 renames) rather than being deleted.\n\nThe design constraint was that a developer must be able to clone ONE\nremote and work on it knowing nothing about this workspace. That is what\nrules out the two obvious mechanisms: a submodule pushes a parent SHA\ndown into every member, and a subtree ends each member''s history at the\nvendoring commit. Both invert the arrow. A manifest keeps it pointing one\nway — the umbrella knows the members, the members know nothing.\n\nThere is also a blunt factual reason. Six of the eleven members have no\ngit remote at all: five are scaffolder-generated demo fixtures that were\nnever published, and `up-ui-bridge` is blocked on INC-016. A submodule\nentry requires a URL. `ws.mjs doctor` reports this rather than hiding it.\n\n`ws.mjs adopt` exists because the repos are already on disk here; it\nsymlinks them into `repos/` so the workspace is demonstrable without\nre-cloning anything. Verified: 11 adopted, 11 clean, doctor accurate.\n\n`status` also surfaced an inconsistency worth knowing about before CI\ndoes: `up-ui-*` are on `main`, `demo-remote-*` on `master`.","tree":{"sha":"bf64ad8bfe5ec6700699ced039bbb8071800fbea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/bf64ad8bfe5ec6700699ced039bbb8071800fbea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDM1YThiMjA3ZGRjMzVkYWI0ZDM0ZjNmMTk0YTc0NzAzMjI2M2M2MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af","sha":"e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af"}],"sha":"35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/35a8b207ddc35dab4d34f3f194a747032263c617"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:47:35Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:47:35Z","email":"platform@teradata.local","name":"platform-poc"},"message":"chore: snapshot the bridge restructure before it was extracted\n\nThis is where `@teradata-pe/bridge` stopped being a folder of flat modules\nand became a package with a shape. The ten files under `packages/bridge/src`\n(`event-bus`, `session`, `theme`, `data-cache`, `task-manager`, `routing`,\n`global`, `http`, `types`, `create-bridge`) were reorganised into\n`core/`, `features/` and `schema/`, and an API baseline was added under\n`etc/`.\n\nThat restructure is the direct ancestor of `up-platform-poc/up-ui-bridge`,\nwhich is where the work continued. Committing it here so the origin is\nrecoverable rather than living only in a dirty working tree.\n\nThree of the modules deleted here have no equivalent in the extracted\npackage yet and are the substance of NEXT_STEPS: `task-manager.ts`\n(cross-remote task tracking), `global.ts` (shared state) and `routing.ts`\n(navigation across remotes).","tree":{"sha":"6793beeec4bfadf8bc318147b20c4887f137b8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/6793beeec4bfadf8bc318147b20c4887f137b8f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGU4NTI1MGUzODFiYjllMWNmZGM4NGUzZjlhNmJjNThlZDk4YjY5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/16abc19b7f2be612af6c2784363993423a8cc0d2","sha":"16abc19b7f2be612af6c2784363993423a8cc0d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/16abc19b7f2be612af6c2784363993423a8cc0d2"}],"sha":"e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e85250e381bb9e1cfdc84e3f9a6bc58ed98b69af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"ht