tars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/d4d9f1d918ec25cdab85262fb437f53b15e1e4f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:38:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:38:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add create-mission-remote scaffolding CLI\n\nNew workspace package (packages/create-mission-remote): an interactive\n@clack/prompts CLI that scaffolds Mission Control remotes aligned with the\nplatform''s \"Governance by Contract, Freedom by Implementation\" model.\n\n- Prompts (or flags, for non-interactive/CI use) for remote name, framework\n  (Angular/React/Svelte), dev port and CI provider, with validation\n  (kebab-case names, port range, shell port 4200 reserved) and MF-safe\n  container naming (fleet-ops -> fleet_ops).\n- Generates package.json wired to @mission/bridge and the framework''s\n  @mission/rsbuild-* preset, plus an rsbuild.config.ts that declares only\n  name/port/exposes (Angular configs stay exported as a function per the\n  async-config constraint; Angular exposes ./routes, React/Svelte ./mount).\n- Agentic scaffolding: .cursorrules + CLAUDE.md with the platform contract\n  (bridge-only global state via native adapters, DOMPurify for raw HTML,\n  MF 2.0 boundaries) and the central MCP server pointer, with\n  framework-specific adapter rules and canonical snippets.\n- CI injection: deploy.yml extending the central reusable workflow, or a\n  .gitlab-ci.yml including the central template.\n- Framework boilerplate: mandatory async-boundary entry, standalone dev\n  bridge bootstrap, mount/routes federation surface, and an App that\n  consumes the bridge ThemeChannel through the framework''s native adapter\n  (useSyncExternalStore / Svelte runes / Angular signals).\n\nGenerated output for all three frameworks typechecks against the real\nworkspace @mission/bridge, React 19 and Angular 20 packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016GQsASqoxa4MzrNoLPJfgi","tree":{"sha":"c94c48631eee4207915b55b5151c67a3408111a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/c94c48631eee4207915b55b5151c67a3408111a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/d4d9f1d918ec25cdab85262fb437f53b15e1e4f7","verification":{"payload":"tree c94c48631eee4207915b55b5151c67a3408111a6\nparent 59c4fdf7a6321334df240e9a1c4c4bca77565b85\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784565502 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784565502 +0000\n\nAdd create-mission-remote scaffolding CLI\n\nNew workspace package (packages/create-mission-remote): an interactive\n@clack/prompts CLI that scaffolds Mission Control remotes aligned with the\nplatform''s \"Governance by Contract, Freedom by Implementation\" model.\n\n- Prompts (or flags, for non-interactive/CI use) for remote name, framework\n  (Angular/React/Svelte), dev port and CI provider, with validation\n  (kebab-case names, port range, shell port 4200 reserved) and MF-safe\n  container naming (fleet-ops -> fleet_ops).\n- Generates package.json wired to @mission/bridge and the framework''s\n  @mission/rsbuild-* preset, plus an rsbuild.config.ts that declares only\n  name/port/exposes (Angular configs stay exported as a function per the\n  async-config constraint; Angular exposes ./routes, React/Svelte ./mount).\n- Agentic scaffolding: .cursorrules + CLAUDE.md with the platform contract\n  (bridge-only global state via native adapters, DOMPurify for raw HTML,\n  MF 2.0 boundaries) and the central MCP server pointer, with\n  framework-specific adapter rules and canonical snippets.\n- CI injection: deploy.yml extending the central reusable workflow, or a\n  .gitlab-ci.yml including the central template.\n- Framework boilerplate: mandatory async-boundary entry, standalone dev\n  bridge bootstrap, mount/routes federation surface, and an App that\n  consumes the bridge ThemeChannel through the framework''s native adapter\n  (useSyncExternalStore / Svelte runes / Angular signals).\n\nGenerated output for all three frameworks typechecks against the real\nworkspace @mission/bridge, React 19 and Angular 20 packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016GQsASqoxa4MzrNoLPJfgi\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIctXUsQ\nT45/wq/4pHGulq9Ea3OX6n1pfzsbUFDC4BbotVLWD4edybDZBAyC+0/0G6RjgPZgp1QNa5A4NiS8\n0wU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T16:38:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_