:81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/dfb404a2dc2f861d0b4bd8f0e8dfde933e166611","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGRmYjQwNGEyZGMyZjg2MWQwYjRiZDhmMGU4ZGZkZTkzM2UxNjY2MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/c768b831a3c40240a646d9931e13a81e203c50d2","sha":"c768b831a3c40240a646d9931e13a81e203c50d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/c768b831a3c40240a646d9931e13a81e203c50d2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4","sha":"a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4"}],"sha":"dfb404a2dc2f861d0b4bd8f0e8dfde933e166611","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/dfb404a2dc2f861d0b4bd8f0e8dfde933e166611"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:13:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:13:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Refactor playground remote to BEM as a commented CSS/SCSS showcase\n\nThe playground remote now demonstrates BEM in both flavours:\n\n- Chrome: styles.scss (via @rsbuild/plugin-sass v1, matching @rsbuild/core\n  1.x) defines commented blocks — pg-playground, pg-card, pg-btn,\n  pg-file-tabs, pg-lang-badge, pg-editor, pg-canvas — using &__element /\n  &--modifier nesting that compiles to flat single-class selectors.\n  Patterns annotated where used: elements over descendant selectors, block\n  and element modifiers, state modifiers bound to component state\n  (pg-btn--busy, pg-canvas__note--alert), the mix pattern\n  (pg-card + pg-playground__section), the $b: & modifier-restyles-element\n  idiom, and BEM-as-scoping replacing Svelte scoped <style> blocks.\n- Canvas: the default virtual documents in defaults.ts are a vanilla-CSS\n  BEM example (brief block with --featured / __cta--ghost modifiers),\n  live-editable in Monaco; comments survive in the editor but are\n  stripped by the sanitizer without touching the unsafe-pattern counter.\n  fleetTableHtml now emits fleet-table__cell--<status> element modifiers\n  instead of orphan .status-* classes.\n\nVerified: full 15-check federation smoke suite plus an 11-check BEM suite\n(computed styles of compiled blocks, shadow-DOM rendering of both\nmodifier flavours, counter at 0 with comments present, live <script>\ninjection flipping pg-canvas__note--alert on).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6","tree":{"sha":"b698e19992654354757a00b88561c58fe9d7ddc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/b698e19992654354757a00b88561c58fe9d7ddc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4","verification":{"payload":"tree b698e19992654354757a00b88561c58fe9d7ddc8\nparent febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784564024 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784564024 +0000\n\nRefactor playground remote to BEM as a commented CSS/SCSS showcase\n\nThe playground remote now demonstrates BEM in both flavours:\n\n- Chrome: styles.scss (via @rsbuild/plugin-sass v1, matching @rsbuild/core\n  1.x) defines commented blocks — pg-playground, pg-card, pg-btn,\n  pg-file-tabs, pg-lang-badge, pg-editor, pg-canvas — using &__element /\n  &--modifier nesting that compiles to flat single-class selectors.\n  Patterns annotated where used: elements over descendant selectors, block\n  and element modifiers, state modifiers bound to component state\n  (pg-btn--busy, pg-canvas__note--alert), the mix pattern\n  (pg-card + pg-playground__section), the $b: & modifier-restyles-element\n  idiom, and BEM-as-scoping replacing Svelte scoped <style> blocks.\n- Canvas: the default virtual documents in defaults.ts are a vanilla-CSS\n  BEM example (brief block with --featured / __cta--ghost modifiers),\n  live-editable in Monaco; comments survive in the editor but are\n  stripped by the sanitizer without touching the unsafe-pattern counter.\n  fleetTableHtml now emits fleet-table__cell--<status> element modifiers\n  instead of orphan .status-* classes.\n\nVerified: full 15-check federation smoke suite plus an 11-check BEM suite\n(computed styles of compiled blocks, shadow-DOM rendering of both\nmodifier flavours, counter at 0 with comments present, live <script>\ninjection flipping pg-canvas__note--alert on).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQABQjKIR\ndBzO1YEambo9Uxll5oVmXkLqg8aDZk1WFKo4KjFTlJw77mosdzV5BCEzAHX2QBmmJ0nElfR6okT8\nEQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T16:13:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGE5ZjJkOGVlNzFkZDdiN2YzY2U1MWE5MjE1N2IyN2I0MDkyYTdiYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe","sha":"febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe"}],"sha":"a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/a9f2d8ee71dd7b7f3ce51a92157b27b4092a7bc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:36:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:36:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Compile bridge contracts before starting dev watchers\n\nFrom a fresh clone, ''pnpm dev'' raced: the app dev servers compiled in\nparallel with @mission/bridge''s first tsc emit, so rspack could not\nresolve the shared module''s fallback (''resolving fallback for shared\nmodule @mission/bridge'' in every importing file). The root dev script now\nruns build:contracts first; the bridge''s tsc --watch keeps dist fresh\nafterwards. Reproduced with a deleted dist, verified 4/4 servers boot\nwith zero resolution errors and the 15-check smoke suite passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6","tree":{"sha":"140820a0124dcb12eaabb440cda82aed8eb5745e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/140820a0124dcb12eaabb440cda82aed8eb5745e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe","verification":{"payload":"tree 140820a0124dcb12eaabb440cda82aed8eb5745e\nparent 2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784180214 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784180214 +0000\n\nCompile bridge contracts before starting dev watchers\n\nFrom a fresh clone, ''pnpm dev'' raced: the app dev servers compiled in\nparallel with @mission/bridge''s first tsc emit, so rspack could not\nresolve the shared module''s fallback (''resolving fallback for shared\nmodule @mission/bridge'' in every importing file). The root dev script now\nruns build:contracts first; the bridge''s tsc --watch keeps dist fresh\nafterwards. Reproduced with a deleted dist, verified 4/4 servers boot\nwith zero resolution errors and the 15-check smoke suite passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFdx+sTy\nisYkxdNglBJY2I96nV8HiWAsEHce7/45fskouLdlvFTqQ83xZqRCDeAj1rkQOOnP1Ilr0MtNEU2k\nzw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:36:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGZlYmMwOTNjNjExYTQyMTBiN2JlNmU1NzUwMzQwOTJlZTdlZGRiZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681","sha":"2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681"}],"sha":"febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/febc093c611a4210b7be6e575034092ee7eddbfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:30:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:30:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Rename designer remote to playground (port 4204) and fix federated reports styles\n\nAlign the Svelte 5 remote with the Mission Control spec: the remote is now\nnamed ''playground'' and serves on port 4204 (was ''designer'' on 4202). The\nrename covers the MF container name, shell remote registration + routes +\nnav, the ''playground:edit'' permission, cache keys, testids, and CSS prefix\n(dsg- -> pg-), plus README/ARCHITECTURE.\n\nAlso move the reports remote''s mcr-* styles out of its standalone-only\nstyles.css into reports-theme.css, imported by the federated ''./routes''\nentry — the shell never loads a remote''s index entry, so the styles must\ntravel with the exposed chunk (rspack emits them as\n__federation_expose_routes.*.css). Verified end-to-end with a 15-check\nPlaywright smoke suite against all four dev servers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6","tree":{"sha":"283c2a47d4b42f76d9623872ac4f5292de99b59b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/283c2a47d4b42f76d9623872ac4f5292de99b59b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681","verification":{"payload":"tree 283c2a47d4b42f76d9623872ac4f5292de99b59b\nparent 76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179806 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179806 +0000\n\nRename designer remote to playground (port 4204) and fix federated reports styles\n\nAlign the Svelte 5 remote with the Mission Control spec: the remote is now\nnamed ''playground'' and serves on port 4204 (was ''designer'' on 4202). The\nrename covers the MF container name, shell remote registration + routes +\nnav, the ''playground:edit'' permission, cache keys, testids, and CSS prefix\n(dsg- -> pg-), plus README/ARCHITECTURE.\n\nAlso move the reports remote''s mcr-* styles out of its standalone-only\nstyles.css into reports-theme.css, imported by the federated ''./routes''\nentry — the shell never loads a remote''s index entry, so the styles must\ntravel with the exposed chunk (rspack emits them as\n__federation_expose_routes.*.css). Verified end-to-end with a 15-check\nPlaywright smoke suite against all four dev servers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEHApS5pgbpy2d6hoRTXs6\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKOJWdMj\n33YSpImFJMv4EnOZ9V0aMv0h595FX8fNISads/q9LFjxggTDGG1paXtlWDBq5J+FLmBZlC/kHa6A\nww8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDJhYWM2NWZmNDk2NWM1MjBkMTgzOTNmYTIwYmQ2ODdjNWViZDI2ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c","sha":"76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c"}],"sha":"2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/2aac65ff4965c520d18393fa20bd687c5ebd2681"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:36:39Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:21:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Use rspack''s declarative ignoreWarnings form for the monaco suppression\n\nThe function predicate typed the warning parameter more narrowly than\nrspack''s WebpackError, failing tsc. Rspack natively supports\n{ message: RegExp, module: RegExp } matchers — same scoping (warning text\nAND monaco-editor module), type-safe, and less code. Verified: warning\nabsent from all builds and the dev browser console; typecheck green\nacross all six packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c","verification":{"payload":"tree eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3\nparent bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151399 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179264 +0000\n\nUse rspack''s declarative ignoreWarnings form for the monaco suppression\n\nThe function predicate typed the warning parameter more narrowly than\nrspack''s WebpackError, failing tsc. Rspack natively supports\n{ message: RegExp, module: RegExp } matchers — same scoping (warning text\nAND monaco-editor module), type-safe, and less code. Verified: warning\nabsent from all builds and the dev browser console; typecheck green\nacross all six packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBGi3c1r\nyXjuZcmmLkDXSo00LIyLtxETFyLjC++8lgk9PZUxW8u9Wq4KVbr69A4ldyi3f/tctl3EUJRsnKcD\nfQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDc2ZGExZmU3MzRjNWQ0NDU0MTk4NTQwODU3YWQ5ODEyMDNiOTUwMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b","sha":"bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b"}],"sha":"76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/76da1fe734c5d4454198540857ad981203b9502c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:34:22Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:21:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Suppress monaco''s dead-AMD-branch ''Critical dependency'' warning\n\nmonaco-editor''s ESM build keeps an AMD fallback in editorSimpleWorker.js\n(`if (!isESM) require([moduleId], ...)`) that Rspack cannot statically\nanalyse. isESM is always true in this build, so the branch is dead code —\nthe warning is noise in every app that bundles Monaco.\n\nAdd a tightly-scoped ignoreWarnings predicate (message match AND\nmodule.resource within monaco-editor) to analytics, designer and reports.\nThe shell never bundles Monaco and needs no change. Verified: warning gone\nfrom all production builds and from the dev browser console across all\nthree Monaco surfaces; full 28-check smoke suite still green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b","verification":{"payload":"tree 067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58\nparent 39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151262 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179264 +0000\n\nSuppress monaco''s dead-AMD-branch ''Critical dependency'' warning\n\nmonaco-editor''s ESM build keeps an AMD fallback in editorSimpleWorker.js\n(`if (!isESM) require([moduleId], ...)`) that Rspack cannot statically\nanalyse. isESM is always true in this build, so the branch is dead code —\nthe warning is noise in every app that bundles Monaco.\n\nAdd a tightly-scoped ignoreWarnings predicate (message match AND\nmodule.resource within monaco-editor) to analytics, designer and reports.\nThe shell never bundles Monaco and needs no change. Verified: warning gone\nfrom all production builds and from the dev browser console across all\nthree Monaco surfaces; full 28-check smoke suite still green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPUSrJH1\nigw5sJ3cdSmSs387uN+fxZbQSZhQVBN20YRuTT9Vv6vicKeidu5PPGZ/jmpSUPMYzlWSA1FF0HhA\nvwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGJiNjU2NTU2OGE3ZTY0NGIzOTM3YzgwMWI1OGY4ODFjZTM2NjE2MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc","sha":"39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc"}],"sha":"bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/bb6565568a7e644b3937c801b58f881ce366162b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:05:50Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:21:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add designer remote: Svelte 5 Monaco CSS/HTML editor with sanitized canvas\n\n- New ''designer'' remote (port 4202): Svelte 5 on Rsbuild, federated via the\n  same framework-agnostic ./mount contract as the React remote (SvelteKit\n  itself is Vite/SSR-bound and cannot join an Rspack federation)\n- Two sections: Monaco editor + live canvas. One editor instance with two\n  models (index.html / styles.css) — setModel() swaps syntax highlighting,\n  language workers and undo stack per file\n- Canvas renders untrusted documents through DOMPurify + a CSS filter into\n  a shadow root; @mission/tokens variables pierce the boundary so previews\n  follow the global theme\n- Full bridge parity: ThemeChannel drives Monaco vs/vs-dark, session gated\n  by shared requirePermission(''designer:edit'') validator, document state\n  persisted in the DataCache, fleet-data reused from the shared cache\n  (one network request across React + Svelte + Angular remotes)\n- Shell: generic RemoteMountOutletComponent replaces the analytics-specific\n  outlet; both mount-contract remotes ride the same component via route data\n- Monaco workers extended with css.worker + html.worker (native Rspack URLs)\n- Smoke suite extended to 28 checks incl. live script-injection stripping;\n  all pass. Docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc","verification":{"payload":"tree a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17\nparent e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784149550 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179264 +0000\n\nAdd designer remote: Svelte 5 Monaco CSS/HTML editor with sanitized canvas\n\n- New ''designer'' remote (port 4202): Svelte 5 on Rsbuild, federated via the\n  same framework-agnostic ./mount contract as the React remote (SvelteKit\n  itself is Vite/SSR-bound and cannot join an Rspack federation)\n- Two sections: Monaco editor + live canvas. One editor instance with two\n  models (index.html / styles.css) — setModel() swaps syntax highlighting,\n  language workers and undo stack per file\n- Canvas renders untrusted documents through DOMPurify + a CSS filter into\n  a shadow root; @mission/tokens variables pierce the boundary so previews\n  follow the global theme\n- Full bridge parity: ThemeChannel drives Monaco vs/vs-dark, session gated\n  by shared requirePermission(''designer:edit'') validator, document state\n  persisted in the DataCache, fleet-data reused from the shared cache\n  (one network request across React + Svelte + Angular remotes)\n- Shell: generic RemoteMountOutletComponent replaces the analytics-specific\n  outlet; both mount-contract remotes ride the same component via route data\n- Monaco workers extended with css.worker + html.worker (native Rspack URLs)\n- Smoke suite extended to 28 checks incl. live script-injection stripping;\n  all pass. Docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEnB+EFL\nhVcAO8vo/3L2bck6kncXOF0X2Jh4/FmzihZ6Xf3bvJqb7PrGwXZPdfJaT01KimmHrcE9nTJyVc+u\nSwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDM5YjVlOTRiOTlkNDBlZGY4YjMzNWNhNmMyMGMzOTc2ZTYwNTYxYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b","sha":"e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b"}],"sha":"39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/39b5e94b99d40edf8b335ca6c20c3976e60561bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:58:20Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:21:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix MF runtime wiring, verify end-to-end, add docs\n\n- Add async boundaries (main -> import(''./bootstrap'')) required by MF 2.0\n  shared-singleton negotiation in all three apps\n- Scope pluginModuleFederation to the ''browser'' environment used by the\n  Angular Rsbuild toolchain (default ''web'' silently no-ops)\n- Disable MF DTS generation (hand-declared remotes.d.ts); the generated\n  @mf-types churn re-triggered the dev watcher\n- Add <base href=\"/\"> to Angular hosts; explicit standalone entry for\n  analytics (src/main.tsx is not Rsbuild''s default entry)\n- README + ARCHITECTURE docs (federation graph, contracts, sharp edges)\n\nVerified with a 19-check Playwright smoke suite against the dev servers:\nremote mounting (Angular routes + React mount), cross-remote SWR cache\ndedupe, Monaco singleton theme propagation, bridge route guards in both\nadapters, persistent TaskManager polling with toast deep-link to cached\nresults. All checks pass; production builds green for all five packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c\nparent ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784127500 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179264 +0000\n\nFix MF runtime wiring, verify end-to-end, add docs\n\n- Add async boundaries (main -> import(''./bootstrap'')) required by MF 2.0\n  shared-singleton negotiation in all three apps\n- Scope pluginModuleFederation to the ''browser'' environment used by the\n  Angular Rsbuild toolchain (default ''web'' silently no-ops)\n- Disable MF DTS generation (hand-declared remotes.d.ts); the generated\n  @mf-types churn re-triggered the dev watcher\n- Add <base href=\"/\"> to Angular hosts; explicit standalone entry for\n  analytics (src/main.tsx is not Rsbuild''s default entry)\n- README + ARCHITECTURE docs (federation graph, contracts, sharp edges)\n\nVerified with a 19-check Playwright smoke suite against the dev servers:\nremote mounting (Angular routes + React mount), cross-remote SWR cache\ndedupe, Monaco singleton theme propagation, bridge route guards in both\nadapters, persistent TaskManager polling with toast deep-link to cached\nresults. All checks pass; production builds green for all five packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDDnZwLK\nMp/MA/VxCovOKNJwxz8BlMca0eVewsBdLm0Db3/aCINc1mVX3949zaIocGZJHRrRr5koaMlQ9pbM\nkQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T05:30:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKGU1M2Q3OTM4MDRlMzg4MjcyNTQ1N2E1MTYzYzYzMzUzMzA1MTllOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29","sha":"ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29"}],"sha":"e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/e53d793804e3882725457a5163c6335330519e8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:01:08Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T05:21:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Scaffold Mission Control MFE POC: bridge contracts, tokens, shell host, analytics and reports remotes\n\n- @mission/bridge: framework-agnostic EventBus, SessionFacade, ThemeChannel,\n  SWR DataCache, persistent TaskManager, route validators, HTTP interceptors\n- @mission/tokens: CSS custom properties driven by html[data-theme]\n- shell (Angular 20 host, :4200): owns the bridge, layout, toasts, MF remotes\n- analytics (React 19 remote, :4201): Monaco SQL workbench via ./mount\n- reports (Angular 20 remote, :4203): Monaco JSON viewer, report generation,\n  federated ./routes with bridge-validator guards\n- Module Federation 2.0 on Rsbuild; monaco-editor shared singleton ^0.52.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"0cfdc862291b85714621798876e4fefe0e06ba16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/0cfdc862291b85714621798876e4fefe0e06ba16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/ca0933f2dac780112ac249462ff878fe17ed9a29","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cfdc862291b85714621798876e4fefe0e06ba16\nparent c768b831a3c40240a646d9931e13a81e203c50d2\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784095268 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784179264 +0000\n\nScaffold Mission Control MFE POC: bridge contracts, tokens, shell host, analytics and reports remotes\n\n- @mission/bridge: framework-agnostic EventBus, SessionFacade, ThemeChannel,\n  SWR DataCache, persistent TaskManager, route validators, HTTP interceptors\n- @mission/tokens: CSS custom properties driven by html[data-theme]\n- shell (Angular 20 host, :4200): owns the bridge, layout, toasts, MF remotes\n- analytics (React 19 remote, :4201): Monaco SQL workbench via ./mount\n- reports (Angular 20 remote, :4203): Monaco JSON viewer, report generation,\n  federated ./routes with bridge-validator guards\n- Module Federation 2.0 on Rsbuild; monaco-editor shared singleton ^0.52.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCl