subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/33d274a571fce29b57ded6af243a100cb8080323/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:36:39Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:36:39Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"message":"Use rspack''s declarative ignoreWarnings form for the monaco suppression\n\nThe function predicate typed the warning parameter more narrowly than\nrspack''s WebpackError, failing tsc. Rspack natively supports\n{ message: RegExp, module: RegExp } matchers — same scoping (warning text\nAND monaco-editor module), type-safe, and less code. Verified: warning\nabsent from all builds and the dev browser console; typecheck green\nacross all six packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/33d274a571fce29b57ded6af243a100cb8080323","verification":{"payload":"tree eaab6af4807aa2b4a8fbd46f21a9fc71bfda90f3\nparent 743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151399 +0000\ncommitter Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151399 +0000\n\nUse rspack''s declarative ignoreWarnings form for the monaco suppression\n\nThe function predicate typed the warning parameter more narrowly than\nrspack''s WebpackError, failing tsc. Rspack natively supports\n{ message: RegExp, module: RegExp } matchers — same scoping (warning text\nAND monaco-editor module), type-safe, and less code. Verified: warning\nabsent from all builds and the dev browser console; typecheck green\nacross all six packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC1puxJ+\nc1h/h/KPs0tZZfWG8bW0YZxg9mTFrULgBdtOpnl9LobI217g51gFdVWOBu7c367eBKhMNeI9SVjT\ngAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/33d274a571fce29b57ded6af243a100cb8080323","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDMzZDI3NGE1NzFmY2UyOWI1N2RlZDZhZjI0M2ExMDBjYjgwODAzMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2","sha":"743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2"}],"sha":"33d274a571fce29b57ded6af243a100cb8080323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/33d274a571fce29b57ded6af243a100cb8080323"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:34:22Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:34:22Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"message":"Suppress monaco''s dead-AMD-branch ''Critical dependency'' warning\n\nmonaco-editor''s ESM build keeps an AMD fallback in editorSimpleWorker.js\n(`if (!isESM) require([moduleId], ...)`) that Rspack cannot statically\nanalyse. isESM is always true in this build, so the branch is dead code —\nthe warning is noise in every app that bundles Monaco.\n\nAdd a tightly-scoped ignoreWarnings predicate (message match AND\nmodule.resource within monaco-editor) to analytics, designer and reports.\nThe shell never bundles Monaco and needs no change. Verified: warning gone\nfrom all production builds and from the dev browser console across all\nthree Monaco surfaces; full 28-check smoke suite still green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/743d780d7526fd0c21ec3729fb147c17c2b40df2","verification":{"payload":"tree 067382c71302d2311d461fd75153f64c17d38f58\nparent 0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151262 +0000\ncommitter Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784151262 +0000\n\nSuppress monaco''s dead-AMD-branch ''Critical dependency'' warning\n\nmonaco-editor''s ESM build keeps an AMD fallback in editorSimpleWorker.js\n(`if (!isESM) require([moduleId], ...)`) that Rspack cannot statically\nanalyse. isESM is always true in this build, so the branch is dead code —\nthe warning is noise in every app that bundles Monaco.\n\nAdd a tightly-scoped ignoreWarnings predicate (message match AND\nmodule.resource within monaco-editor) to analytics, designer and reports.\nThe shell never bundles Monaco and needs no change. Verified: warning gone\nfrom all production builds and from the dev browser console across all\nthree Monaco surfaces; full 28-check smoke suite still green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsA