privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:05:50Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:05:50Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"message":"Add designer remote: Svelte 5 Monaco CSS/HTML editor with sanitized canvas\n\n- New ''designer'' remote (port 4202): Svelte 5 on Rsbuild, federated via the\n  same framework-agnostic ./mount contract as the React remote (SvelteKit\n  itself is Vite/SSR-bound and cannot join an Rspack federation)\n- Two sections: Monaco editor + live canvas. One editor instance with two\n  models (index.html / styles.css) — setModel() swaps syntax highlighting,\n  language workers and undo stack per file\n- Canvas renders untrusted documents through DOMPurify + a CSS filter into\n  a shadow root; @mission/tokens variables pierce the boundary so previews\n  follow the global theme\n- Full bridge parity: ThemeChannel drives Monaco vs/vs-dark, session gated\n  by shared requirePermission(''designer:edit'') validator, document state\n  persisted in the DataCache, fleet-data reused from the shared cache\n  (one network request across React + Svelte + Angular remotes)\n- Shell: generic RemoteMountOutletComponent replaces the analytics-specific\n  outlet; both mount-contract remotes ride the same component via route data\n- Monaco workers extended with css.worker + html.worker (native Rspack URLs)\n- Smoke suite extended to 28 checks incl. live script-injection stripping;\n  all pass. Docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3","verification":{"payload":"tree a0f040c5c01bc02d7903c0628484009b6b2b5c17\nparent b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784149550 +0000\ncommitter Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784149550 +0000\n\nAdd designer remote: Svelte 5 Monaco CSS/HTML editor with sanitized canvas\n\n- New ''designer'' remote (port 4202): Svelte 5 on Rsbuild, federated via the\n  same framework-agnostic ./mount contract as the React remote (SvelteKit\n  itself is Vite/SSR-bound and cannot join an Rspack federation)\n- Two sections: Monaco editor + live canvas. One editor instance with two\n  models (index.html / styles.css) — setModel() swaps syntax highlighting,\n  language workers and undo stack per file\n- Canvas renders untrusted documents through DOMPurify + a CSS filter into\n  a shadow root; @mission/tokens variables pierce the boundary so previews\n  follow the global theme\n- Full bridge parity: ThemeChannel drives Monaco vs/vs-dark, session gated\n  by shared requirePermission(''designer:edit'') validator, document state\n  persisted in the DataCache, fleet-data reused from the shared cache\n  (one network request across React + Svelte + Angular remotes)\n- Shell: generic RemoteMountOutletComponent replaces the analytics-specific\n  outlet; both mount-contract remotes ride the same component via route data\n- Monaco workers extended with css.worker + html.worker (native Rspack URLs)\n- Smoke suite extended to 28 checks incl. live script-injection stripping;\n  all pass. Docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFPWBrq9\nziKt/VIQlN1JT9SUCXgUac/2zqgtKWFIYivIJVHtpQfbWRqp9hjvSn5M89VFBRk2l/wrAQVy9BB2\nrAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3","node_id":"C_kwDOTY9HVdoAKDBiODcwNjA1YzA1YTI2NGUzYmU4MWM1NzIwNjJjYjY5MWEyYjRhZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commit/b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2","sha":"b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2"}],"sha":"0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/0b870605c05a264e3be81c572062cb691a2b4af3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/commits/b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:58:20Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:58:20Z","email":"robertcl795.rc@gmail.com","name":"Robert CL"},"message":"Fix MF runtime wiring, verify end-to-end, add docs\n\n- Add async boundaries (main -> import(''./bootstrap'')) required by MF 2.0\n  shared-singleton negotiation in all three apps\n- Scope pluginModuleFederation to the ''browser'' environment used by the\n  Angular Rsbuild toolchain (default ''web'' silently no-ops)\n- Disable MF DTS generation (hand-declared remotes.d.ts); the generated\n  @mf-types churn re-triggered the dev watcher\n- Add <base href=\"/\"> to Angular hosts; explicit standalone entry for\n  analytics (src/main.tsx is not Rsbuild''s default entry)\n- README + ARCHITECTURE docs (federation graph, contracts, sharp edges)\n\nVerified with a 19-check Playwright smoke suite against the dev servers:\nremote mounting (Angular routes + React mount), cross-remote SWR cache\ndedupe, Monaco singleton theme propagation, bridge route guards in both\nadapters, persistent TaskManager polling with toast deep-link to cached\nresults. All checks pass; production builds green for all five packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7","tree":{"sha":"0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/trees/0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Robertcl795/MFEs-Mission-Control/git/commits/b1ed1a1651cb41fac51232a7b332178ef0b468a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a62396b422ec5b03663488450e9248804c68f4c\nparent c7fe680892784a8cd4384f6669aee3dfc1a9d334\nauthor Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784127500 +0000\ncommitter Robert CL <robertcl795.rc@gmail.com> 1784127500 +0000\n\nFix MF runtime wiring, verify end-to-end, add docs\n\n- Add async boundaries (main -> import(''./bootstrap'')) required by MF 2.0\n  shared-singleton negotiation in all three apps\n- Scope pluginModuleFederation to the ''browser'' environment used by the\n  Angular Rsbuild toolchain (default ''web'' silently no-ops)\n- Disable MF DTS generation (hand-declared remotes.d.ts); the generated\n  @mf-types churn re-triggered the dev watcher\n- Add <base href=\"/\"> to Angular hosts; explicit standalone entry for\n  analytics (src/main.tsx is not Rsbuild''s default entry)\n- README + ARCHITECTURE docs (federation graph, contracts, sharp edges)\n\nVerified with a 19-check Playwright smoke suite against the dev servers:\nremote mounting (Angular routes + React mount), cross-remote SWR cache\ndedupe, Monaco singleton theme propagation, bridge route guards in both\nadapters, persistent TaskManager polling with toast deep-link to cached\nresults. All checks pass; production builds green for all five packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XLPbNxosChsMEi2QWiMXT7\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLMwiaDP\n/04kYv2HiiSQQUiOz3pv/en8A7vje/95+yIbx3MkM1HqJ866u0giyOTro8KhaiYQEdlpWmWK7Yv2\nMQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32170285?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Robertcl795","id":32170285,"login":"Robertcl795","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTcwMjg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robertcl795/starred{