e","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/saml-login-provider/commits/8f08d55e06f020883f178ce166efa676d7d62abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:35:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:35:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"test: verify the new a11y behavior from the WCAG 2.2 AAA fixes\n\nRe-verified the e2e suite against a real dockerized Jahia after commits\n5dbf92a (a11y fixes: visible Cancel acknowledgment, Retry action on the\nload-error state, aria-invalid/aria-describedby wiring on the login page''s\ncredential fields) and 9b98264 (docs only). Rather than just re-running the\nexisting assertions, added coverage for the actual new behavior:\n\n- 01-samlLoginProviderSettings.cy.ts: the \"cancels edits\" test now also\n  asserts the visible \"Changes discarded.\" acknowledgment appears (previously\n  only announced via the aria-live region, invisible to sighted users).\n- 02-samlLoginRedirect.cy.ts: new test drives a real failed login attempt on\n  /saml-login and confirms #login-error is shown with role=\"alert\" and that\n  both #username and #password get aria-invalid=\"true\" +\n  aria-describedby=\"login-error\" only after the failed attempt (not before).\n\nVerified: 01 8/8 passing, 02 4/4 passing, full suite green\n(\"Full execution successful\").\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"907254a12183fd00c23c25f6dac175672994d1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/saml-login-provider/git/trees/907254a12183fd00c23c25f6dac175672994d1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/saml-login-provider/git/commits/8f08d55e06f020883f178ce166efa676d7d62abd","verification":{"payload":"tree 907254a12183fd00c23c25f6dac175672994d1b7\nparent 9b98264835d98e6fb7022c80801ef10803c8cff8\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1784104500 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1784104500 +0200\n\ntest: verify the new a11y behavior from the WCAG 2.2 AAA fixes\n\nRe-verified the e2e suite against a real dockerized Jahia after commits\n5dbf92a (a11y fixes: visible Cancel acknowledgment, Retry action on the\nload-error state, aria-invalid/aria-describedby wiring on the login page''s\ncredential fields) and 9b98264 (docs only). Rather than just re-running the\nexisting assertions, added coverage for the actual new behavior:\n\n- 01-samlLoginProviderSettings.cy.ts: the \"cancels edits\" test now also\n  asserts the visible \"Changes discarded.\" acknowledgment appears (previously\n  only announced via the aria-live region, invisible to sighted users).\n- 02-samlLoginRedirect.cy.ts: new test drives a real failed login attempt on\n  /saml-login and confirms #login-error is shown with role=\"alert\" and that\n  both #username and #password get aria-invalid=\"true\" +\n  aria-describedby=\"login-error\" only after the failed attempt (not before).\n\nVerified: 01 8/8 passing, 02 4/4 passing, full suite green\n(\"Full execution successful\").\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpXRjQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kBBQf+K5Y0OXSj+DXBT+UAXaooYTEH0M8OwXS3PccIVxCRwmrsYqfxAQB0wlpR\nxp1EBBoruloW9nhNtSgw1J/IwvA/ayJISFmRhuY/j4VUWuoXrOobCtZ6EufCo9Y4\nxmDxW4HK9+aURK72uZl9vHV1yzlxrgannuDxciFX2OY3sUVsXS13302mwkemjbjz\nAVfL+I1m079aSo1Y2WCdE2B75qdtD7jg9wNENK3YYtw45KaOFy2WVimuPMZFfYUF\n2BTAyUksucTrYEJGxZoZfBJCUEQo5AZMpYBlqezZjnYysK73wZ7qPeMQ1r4gC4Lv\nlWY8qQnOmriYRUgN16LuKdEgcaptJQ==\n=/9Qa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T08:38:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.