m hostname length\n- Add critical deployment warning: each configured host must have\n  saml-authentication-valve properly configured to avoid login lockout (400 errors)\n- Update AGENTS.md Gotchas to document .cfg file deployment convention\n  (won''t be overridden on redeployment, preserving admin changes)\n- Add Gotchas note on login lockout risk and operational prerequisites\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmpXQskACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lYRAgAgEUn0AsslCeXoDwGBu4QgZGMDe++w/1P4VzAP1BtTD2MgdevuzJfDMwa\nGFHYnGE4JSM7LDNFVoCN3L7aC193RBbqJVcX2Z1gY+rxMIBwqG2zP7ZdsHvQiAu6\n5ZvyUuBDKeD79AvJQK4Qm1PumAOsZ/WBzaFHjQ0yfj1IF49PRHhd9oNc0NIoIBOh\nsRbOHpVIzaCv7xcXme7WyTHwT6YfziOYD2zBmCj26lq+T53JDtTJgKgBpvxKvRKb\n5F1OzijJvp5k0LcmT5Zu3cRUnA5vkII6/DeGtA6JNLYC4x5QdVnhhyWyWBpLtvhT\nZl8kQFqjTQinDbrgImpHF4/b4GPx+g==\n=TY2I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T08:38:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/saml-login-provider/commit/9b9826483