ps://github.com/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/commit/1cb7baf8dd4a55b732a21cc6056a116ade3a4e81","sha":"1cb7baf8dd4a55b732a21cc6056a116ade3a4e81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/commits/1cb7baf8dd4a55b732a21cc6056a116ade3a4e81"}],"sha":"5905aedb5333e1e1487d0ea9e63dd0c76401c609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/commits/5905aedb5333e1e1487d0ea9e63dd0c76401c609"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41873019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pikann","id":41873019,"login":"pikann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODczMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/commits/1cb7baf8dd4a55b732a21cc6056a116ade3a4e81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T11:59:42Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T11:59:42Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann"},"message":"feat: register condition/action automation nodes + entry_created trigger\n\nContributes this plugin''s own trigger, Condition, and Action node\ntypes to the automation graph:\n\n- com.paca.time-logging.entry_created (trigger): fires whenever a\n  time log entry is created. Backed by a new event emitted from\n  createTimeLog in timelogs.go.\n- com.paca.time-logging.total_minutes_exceeds (condition): sums\n  minutes logged against a task (optionally filtered to one member)\n  and matches when the total exceeds a configured threshold. Summed\n  in Go rather than via SQL SUM/COALESCE so it works identically\n  against both the real Postgres backend and the plugintest\n  in-memory DB, which only supports simple column-projection + WHERE\n  matching (see plugin-sdk-go/plugintest/backends.go).\n- com.paca.time-logging.log_time (action): logs a time entry against\n  a task on a plugin''s/automation''s behalf, with idempotency-key\n  based retry protection (verified by a test that checks a retried\n  run does not double-insert).\n\nRegisters all three via ctx.Condition()/ctx.Action() in plugin.go\n(trigger registration is manifest-only - the event is emitted from\nexisting application code), and adds the automation block to\nplugin.json.\n\nNOTE: go.mod has a temporary ''replace'' pointing at the sibling\nplugin-sdk-go checkout, needed because this PR depends on\nplugin-sdk-go''s not-yet-released Condition/Action SDK support (see\nPaca-AI/plugin-sdk-go branch feat/automation-condition-action-nodes).\nMust be swapped for a real pinned version once that SDK change is\ntagged and released - do not merge with the replace directive still\nin place.\n\nVerified: go vet clean, 8 new tests pass (including the idempotency\nretry test), GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm build succeeds (produces a\nworking .wasm binary).","tree":{"sha":"fc5f780e8e9623e60f865e7c8788ac821aeed8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/git/trees/fc5f780e8e9623e60f865e7c8788ac821aeed8ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-time-logging/git/commits/1cb7baf8dd4a55b732a21cc6056a116ade3a4e81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c