/jishnupavithran007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/commits/f9a212cf51489a6bdddea7d414374444a84db765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:56:54Z","email":"jishnu.pavithran@thoughtspot.com","name":"jishnu.pavithran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:56:54Z","email":"jishnu.pavithran@thoughtspot.com","name":"jishnu.pavithran"},"message":"Add a Tier 3 (low-risk) dependency: ms\n\nms only ships patch updates and never breaks, so its upgrade (2.1.2 -> 2.1.3)\nis a clean Tier 3 -> verify passes -> auto-merge. Exercises the low-risk lane\nalongside the Tier 1 breaking upgrades.","tree":{"sha":"460f7355dfc6115a1d27483bad7bd456ff3fbf7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/trees/460f7355dfc6115a1d27483bad7bd456ff3fbf7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/commits/f9a212cf51489a6bdddea7d414374444a84db765","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198571603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jishnupavithran007","id":198571603,"login":"jishnupavithran007","node_id":"U_kgDOC9X2Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"