05a6db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:14:51Z","email":"jishnu.pavithran@thoughtspot.com","name":"jishnu.pavithran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:14:51Z","email":"jishnu.pavithran@thoughtspot.com","name":"jishnu.pavithran"},"message":"Next-major-only: cap every dependency to its next major (true stair-step)\n\nReplace renovate.json with renovate.config.js, which scans the workspace and\nadds an allowedVersions cap of ''current major + next only'' per dependency. So a\ndep at v27 gets ONE PR to v28 — no PR is created for v29/v30. The cap is\nrecomputed from current versions each run, so after merging 27->28 the next run\noffers 28->29 automatically. renovate.yml points at the JS config via\nRENOVATE_CONFIG_FILE.","tree":{"sha":"479b683a9126988f4899545a87996cf79b00ca20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/trees/479b683a9126988f4899545a87996cf79b00ca20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/commits/959d27aba7e74eb6ac4e9bb1b38334a6a305a6db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198571603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jishnupavithran007","id":198571603,"login":"jishnupavithran007","node_id":"U_kgDOC9X2Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git