n- Stage 4: check-guardrails.mjs (blocks suppressions, config edits, and\n  upgraded-but-no-longer-imported deps) — verified it catches the chalk\n  shortcut\n- verify-and-heal workflow now runs Stage 4 after healing and routes to\n  human-review when the fix is green-but-wrong\n\nRepo is now self-contained: its own Actions run discover -> verify -> heal\n-> guardrails independently.","tree":{"sha":"564e57d582c038f8973ed85941a383e975931f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/trees/564e57d582c038f8973ed85941a383e975931f88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/commits/df54cc62ef40588981ef7747000f63fb45cd5590","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198571603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jishnupavithran007","id":198571603,"login":"jishnupavithran007","node_id":"U_kgDOC9X2Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/commit/df54cc62ef40588981ef7747000f63fb45cd5590","node_id":"C_kwDOTZBhVtoA