 pipeline: Renovate + verify-and-heal GitHub Actions\n\n- .github/workflows/renovate.yml: scheduled Stage 1 (opens upgrade PRs);\n  needs secret RENOVATE_TOKEN\n- .github/workflows/verify-and-heal.yml: on each chore/upgrade-* PR runs\n  Stage 2 (verify affected), and on failure Stage 3 (Claude heals via\n  headless claude CLI using secret ANTHROPIC_API_KEY), pushes the fix back\n  to the PR branch, escalates with a needs-human-review label if it cannot\n- tools/upgrade-automation/heal-upgrade.sh + prompts/fixer.v1.md: the loop\n  the workflow calls\n\nMakes the pipeline run independently in CI with its own credentials.","tree":{"sha":"bcfb9dacd89351bdcd6669908a3685c6ff22d7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/trees/bcfb9dacd89351bdcd6669908a3685c6ff22d7da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jishnupavithran007/vuln-check-repo/git/commits/fb172ee38577ab5e7fde1a39e29903ff14c851b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198571603?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jishnupavithran007","id":198571603,"login":"jishnupavithran007","node_id":"U_kgDOC9X2Uw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jishnupavithran007/subscription