:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/e215da7153078afee0a3079299198523b337c621","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKGUyMTVkYTcxNTMwNzhhZmVlMGEzMDc5Mjk5MTk4NTIzYjMzN2M2MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb","sha":"4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5","sha":"fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5"}],"sha":"e215da7153078afee0a3079299198523b337c621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/e215da7153078afee0a3079299198523b337c621"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:58:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T13:58:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(deps): clear all high advisories, vitest 5, jsdom 30, CI actions v7\n\nnpm audit: 5 high / 6 moderate -> 0 high / 0 critical. The 3 residual moderates\nare ONE advisory counted per carrier path: adm-zip@0.6.0 via\n@module-federation/vite@1.20.7 -> dts-plugin@2.8.2. No patched version exists,\nand 1.21.5 still pins it via dts-plugin@2.9.0. Unreachable here regardless:\nloadPluginDts early-returns on `dts: false`, which vite.config.js sets, so the\nmodule is never dynamically imported.\n\nNo `overrides` were needed. Every declared range already permitted a patched\nversion (browserslist ^4.24.0, js-yaml ^4.3.0, brace-expansion ^1.1.7); npm had\nbeen reusing satisfying-but-stale copies from node_modules. A clean resolve\nfixed all five with no permanent config cruft: browserslist 4.28.9, js-yaml\n4.3.2, brace-expansion 1.1.18, postcss 8.5.28, nanoid 3.3.18,\nbaseline-browser-mapping 2.11.21.\n\nvitest 3.2.7 -> 5.0.0, jsdom 27.0.1 -> 30.0.1, @testing-library/jest-dom\n6.9.1 -> 7.0.1, react/react-dom 19.3.0, vite 8.3.0, plus minors.\nCI: checkout@v4 -> v7, setup-node@v4 -> v7 (three majors; setup-node v7''s\naction.yml read directly — node-version-file and cache both unchanged).\nLockfile regenerated to v3 from v2, which is most of the diff (+3905 / -9823).\n\nRemoves a config block that Vite 8 had silently stopped honouring.\n`esbuild: { jsx: ''automatic'' }` was dead — Vite 8 transforms via oxc and warned\nit was ignoring the option. It is DELETED rather than migrated to an `oxc`\nblock, because @vitejs/plugin-react@6.1.1 already sets\n`oxc: { jsx: { runtime: ''automatic'', importSource, refresh } }` in its own config\nhook; an explicit user block would duplicate the plugin and could clobber its\nFast Refresh setting. react() is active under Vitest too, so test-file JSX is\ncovered. Verified from emitted output rather than exit code: in the app chunk,\nReact.createElement = 0 and any .createElement = 0, while react/jsx-runtime is\nimported as a federated shared module.\n\nengines.node -> `^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0`, verified with semver as\nexactly the intersection of jsdom 30 and vitest 5 across boundary probes: it\ncorrectly rejects 22.12.0 and 24.0.0, which vitest 5 accepts but jsdom 30\nrefuses. jsdom is the binding constraint, not vitest. .nvmrc''s 24 satisfies it.\nCLAUDE.md''s Node prose is updated in the same change: it claimed \"Any Node >=\n22.12 works\", which this makes false.\n\nESLint stays 9.x. eslint-plugin-react@7.37.5 peers ^9.7 and\neslint-plugin-jsx-a11y@6.10.2 peers ^9, both are the latest published versions,\nso eslint 10 would need repo-wide legacy-peer-deps — disabling peer checking for\nevery package to gain three lint rules. Declined; eslint.config.js is untouched.\n\n@module-federation/vite stays exact 1.20.7 on documented grounds: the plugin\nships behaviour changes in PATCH releases. The federation contract was\nre-verified after React 19.2.8 -> 19.3.0 in the built share map — singleton x4,\nstrictVersion x4, requiredVersion ^19.0.0 x4.\n\n8 test files / 85 tests, lint, format:check and build all green; npm ci exits 0\nwith no EBADENGINE.\n\nNOT verified: the federated mount. The build emits remoteEntry.js and the ./App\nexpose and the share map is intact, but this remote was not loaded in the host.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4da4ccd71f52664f7aa6cf34b67f55cc5265122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/c4da4ccd71f52664f7aa6cf34b67f55cc5265122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/fb1991efa9cd34d97c63fc9b53858f994fbd2ae5","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKGZiMTk5MWVmYTljZDM0ZDk3YzYzZmM5YjUzODU4Zjk5NGZiZDJhZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb","sha":"4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/4ad