tps://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69","sha":"b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69"}],"sha":"4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/4ad4abb4e0c1d0d426680fa9d5d82145a04fbbbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:53:26Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:53:26Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(mf): pin @module-federation/vite exactly, fix dev-mode contract note\n\nPin the plugin to an exact 1.20.7 (drop the caret). This plugin ships\nbehaviour changes in PATCH releases -- #1038 removed implicit sharing in\n1.20.5, and #1042/#1058/#1061 changed share-init and init() semantics in\n1.20.6 -- so a caret invites silent drift into a strict federation\ncontract. The old lockfile pin at 1.18.0 is precisely what made this\nupgrade a controlled single-variable change; an exact range keeps that\nproperty.\n\nAlso correct the strict-enforcement bullet in CLAUDE.md. Its claim that a\nviolation surfaces as four console.error lines at initial page load, with\nthe console as the gate, holds for production builds but not for\n`vite dev` after this upgrade. That matters more here than in the shell:\nthis project runs standalone, so dev is the mode it is actually developed\nin.\n\n  - The eager host-init share loop lost its `.concat` of the remaining\n    usedShared keys and gained `if (!share || share.materialize === false)\n    continue` (lib/index.js:4656, 4675). runtime.loadShare -- where the\n    strictVersion check fires -- is inside that loop (:4687).\n  - Builds are unaffected: lib/index.js:7958 selects addUsedShares over\n    addConfiguredShare when the command is not \"serve\", and only\n    addUsedShares populates the materialized set, so `vite build`\n    materializes every configured share. Verified in dist: materialize:!0\n    x4, materialize:!1 x0.\n  - On a cold 1.20.7 dev server the share map has 8 keys with only `react`\n    and `react-dom/client` materialized, the other 6 false. All 8 still\n    carry strictVersion: true. The materialized set grows as the module\n    graph warms (a warmed server showed 5 of 8), so the doc states that\n    dependency rather than a fixed list.\n\nNet: in dev the strict check moved from eager-at-bootstrap to\nlazy-at-first-import, so a violation throws mid-render instead of blanking\nthe page at load. The existing \"blanks its own deployment -- not just\n`npm run dev`\" phrasing was corrected to \"deployed build\" for the same\nreason.\n\nContract re-verified in the built share map: singleton, requiredVersion\n^19.0.0, strictVersion and react 19.2.8 all still 4 of 4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc22bfcbc015a8a6f05fd64d44bb465b1a7ee972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/fc22bfcbc015a8a6f05fd64d44bb465b1a7ee972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKGI2N2EyN2M0M2RjYzM5ZGIzOTY3MDg5ZjNkN2FmNjFjYTYyMTRiNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97","sha":"ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97"}],"sha":"b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/b67a27c43dcc39db3967089f3d7af61ca6214b69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:05:57Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:05:57Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(mf): upgrade @module-federation/vite to 1.20.7\n\nBumps @module-federation/vite from ^1.18.0 to ^1.20.7, moving every\n@module-federation/* transitive from 2.7.0 to 2.8.2. Also bumps the dev\nversion 5.1.0 -> 5.2.0.\n\nThis upgrade was deliberately held back until the narrowed shared React\ncontract landed (#28), because it changes the runtime that enforces that\ncontract. The acceptance criterion was therefore not \"it builds\" but\n\"the contract is still present and still enforced\".\n\nThe contract semantics are provably untouched: runtime-core''s\ndist/utils/share.js -- which implements the strictVersion / singleton /\nrequiredVersion checks -- is byte-identical between 2.7.0 and 2.8.2\n(md5 45d8e678691db34e5769176e1d05c354, matching portfolio-shell and\nclimb-trainer).\n\nVerified in the built share map, 4 of each: singleton, requiredVersion\n^19.0.0, strictVersion, and react 19.2.8. A 1.18.0 baseline was captured\nbefore the bump so the comparison is like-for-like.\n\nFederated smoke test against a locally-served remote: the dashboard mounts\nwith real data, 0 \"Failed to bridge external shared module\" lines,\n0 uncaught page errors, exactly 1 React instance. Note this repo''s green\nunit tests say nothing about MF -- the federation plugin is disabled under\nVITEST=true.\n\ndts-plugin''s typescript peer range widened to admit TS 7, so this repo''s\nauto-installed peer floats 6.0.3 -> 7.0.2 and adds 20 platform binaries.\nLeft as-is: it is dev-only and, with no tsconfig and dts: false, the\ncompiler is never invoked.\n\nNo BREAKING CHANGE is declared anywhere in the range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a05a6a386ed166c561b37db81f6bcf01ecc8081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/9a05a6a386ed166c561b37db81f6bcf01ecc8081"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKGVhODE4ZjkwMzM1NThhN2YwMTBkZDU3YmU4YTNhMTFmOTJjODNhOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c","sha":"730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c"}],"sha":"ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/ea818f9033558a7f010dd57be8a3a11f92c83a97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://ap