GNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T11:35:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKDczMGJmMTM1NWQ4MjMyZmQ3ZmYyNmUzOTA4MmM2YTZlMzM0NWJjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/4f65f1034d1b1ae63d910f70bce7280b0a35e345","sha":"4f65f1034d1b1ae63d910f70bce7280b0a35e345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/4f65f1034d1b1ae63d910f70bce7280b0a35e345"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149","sha":"605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149"}],"sha":"730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/730bf1355d8232fd7ff26e39082c6a6e3345bc3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:30:48Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:30:48Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"docs: correct the strict-contract description after review\n\nActs on review findings, plus a read of the @module-federation source that\nneither the original experiment nor the review had done.\n\nThe previous wording had this repo on the \"weak side\" of the contract, which is\nwrong in the mode that matters most here. Enforcement follows bootstrap order,\nnot host vs. remote: whichever container boots first with an empty shared-module\ncache throws and never mounts. This project ships a standalone entry, and\nstandalone it boots first — so a range its own installed React cannot satisfy\nblanks its own deployment, not merely `npm run dev`. Federated under the shell,\nthe shell boots first, so the same mistake only logs, four lines, one per shared\nkey, at initial page load.\n\nAlso documents that strictVersion is inert without singleton: true, and demotes\nsingle-React behaviour from a benefit of strict to a hazard — it holds only\nbecause the first container to boot seeds the page-global share cache. Adds the\nnext-major playbook: widen the range, upgrade both repos, re-narrow.\n\nTwo independent passes disagreed on which internal call throws, so no call site\nis named — only the behaviour, which they agree on.\n\nThe eslint comment still said React 18.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d9ad66868b48aaa2657eec89f64c8e912c9702c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/2d9ad66868b48aaa2657eec89f64c8e912c9702c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKDYwNTExMGViMDY0ZmY3MjYzYjU5NDExM2Q3ZWNlMTUzZDNkMjExNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/52b2bbc08c2aaaa36d3b572655bfc08e17956cb0","sha":"52b2bbc08c2aaaa36d3b572655bfc08e17956cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/52b2bbc08c2aaaa36d3b572655bfc08e17956cb0"}],"sha":"605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/605110eb064ff7263b594113d7ece153d3d21149"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/52b2bbc08c2aaaa36d3b572655bfc08e17956cb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:56:16Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:56:16Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore(mf): narrow the shared React contract to ^19.0.0 + strictVersion: true\n\nTrack 0 round 3 of 3, closing the React 19 rollout. The tolerant\n''^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0'' range existed only to make the two-step production\npromotion safe; rounds 1 and 2 are shipped, so it is spent.\n\nThis repo is on the weak side of the contract, and CLAUDE.md now says so.\nExperiment (2026-08-17): a remote whose requiredVersion does not match has its\nstrict violation caught by @module-federation/vite, which logs \"Failed to bridge\nexternal shared module\" and mounts anyway, with no duplicate React. Only the\nhost''s own share resolution throws. So strict does not make this remote fail\nfast on a mismatch, it upgrades the warning to a console.error.\n\nNote the test suite is silent on all of this: the federation plugin is disabled\nunder VITEST=true, so a green run says nothing about the MF contract. The\nevidence is the browser experiment recorded in the paired host PR.\n\nPaired with portfolio-shell#44. Version 5.0.0 -> 5.1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9c9eed226e733fbfedd257e34e3cc66818d1875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/f9c9eed226e733fbfedd257e34e3cc66818d1875"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/52b2bbc08c2aaaa36d3b572655bfc08e17956cb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k