026-08-17T09:20:40Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:20:40Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore: upgrade React to 19.2.8 and widen the MF shared range\n\n- react + react-dom ^18.2.0 -> ^19.2.8; react-chartjs-2 ^5.2.0 -> ^5.3.1\n  (React 19 support landed in 5.3.0)\n- MF shared: requiredVersion ''^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0'' with an explicit\n  strictVersion: false, so the range tolerates both majors during the\n  rollout. Narrows to ''^19.0.0'' + strictVersion: true once both repos\n  are on 19 in production.\n- add resolve.dedupe [''react'', ''react-dom''] - @vitejs/plugin-react 6 no\n  longer adds it and duplicate React under federation is the failure mode\n- delete build.target ''chrome89''; Vite 8''s default baseline already\n  supports the top-level await MF needs, so the pin only lowered the\n  baseline. Its stated justification was false.\n\nNo src/ changes and no test changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd3442cc214b7d28ad60c7877325515f81990650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/fd3442cc214b7d28ad60c7877325515f81990650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/24f9972b700da5251f902591d6354c3769c6cc2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organ