:"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/0d2d04b433aaf6cbc894f1dfa68a57667144f5ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:34:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:34:24Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"fix: resolve the NAV proxy origin from the remote''s own module URL\n\nFederated into the shell, the remote runs on the host''s origin\n(kilianmc.com), so the relative `/api/nav` request hit the shell instead of\nthis app. The shell''s SPA rewrite answers every path with index.html, so the\ncall returned `200 text/html` rather than a 404 — `res.ok` was true, the\nsubsequent `res.json()` threw, and the bare catch swallowed it into an empty\nMap. Imports appeared to succeed with every fund silently unpriced and\nexcluded from totals.\n\n`VITE_NAV_API_URL` was the intended escape hatch but was never set in Vercel,\nso the deployed bundle shipped an empty base.\n\n- navService: `resolveBaseUrl()` derives the base from `import.meta.url` (the\n  origin this chunk was served from), so the remote always calls its own\n  backend. Precedence: VITE_NAV_API_URL override -> module origin ->\n  same-origin. Needs no env config and covers every preview URL.\n- navService: validate the response content-type, so an HTML answer is a\n  failed lookup with a console.warn naming the cause, not a mystery parse\n  error. A missing header still attempts the parse.\n- PortfolioDataContext: when nothing prices at all, say the pricing service\n  was unreachable instead of implying the file''s ISINs were unresolvable.\n- Document the origin constraint in CLAUDE.md and demote VITE_NAV_API_URL to\n  an override in .env.example.\n\nVerified cross-origin locally: `vercel dev` serving this remote with a live\n/api/nav on :3000, shell dev on :5173 loading from it — import prices the\nfunds. Bumps the dev minor to 3.1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74f2f5c83d84c7b7a70f71d5d07ae12ab1dc2e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/74f2f5c83d84c7b7a70f71d5d07ae12ab1dc2e10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/0d2d04b433aaf6cbc894f1dfa68a57667144f5ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/0d2d04b433aaf6cbc894f1dfa68a57667144f5ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKDBkMmQwNGI0MzNhYWY2Y2JjODk0ZjFkZmE2OGE1NzY2NzE0NGY1ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/61ffb390be3511968d812e6b2adc6265cfa48114","sha":"61ffb390be3511968d812e6b2adc6265cfa48114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/61ffb390be351196