 Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a35ed06a6f0f658542a2e25aec8872f0e6f82e99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/a35ed06a6f0f658542a2e25aec8872f0e6f82e99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/eeb9321fea4c68229755f0c7e9e2290b9cb5e371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/eeb9321fea4c68229755f0c7e9e2290b9cb5e371","node_id":"C_kwDOTZNhhdoAKGVlYjkzMjFmZWE0YzY4MjI5NzU1ZjBjN2U5ZTIyOTBiOWNiNWUzNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commit/25409a98e6f8c9031f5d31e7afa086a6b61a9e2a","sha":"25409a98e6f8c9031f5d31e7afa086a6b61a9e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/25409a98e6f8c9031f5d31e7afa086a6b61a9e2a"}],"sha":"eeb9321fea4c68229755f0c7e9e2290b9cb5e371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/eeb9321fea4c68229755f0c7e9e2290b9cb5e371"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/commits/25409a98e6f8c9031f5d31e7afa086a6b61a9e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T11:00:50Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T11:00:50Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat: import holdings from file with live NAV, gain/loss, and per-line errors\n\nAdd the ability to load a portfolio from a JSON or CSV file (fund ISIN,\nnumber of shares, cost-basis price, optional type) and value it against\nlive market NAV. The existing hardcoded data remains the default until a\nfile is imported.\n\n- Serverless proxy `api/nav.js`: keyless Yahoo ISIN->NAV lookup\n  (search -> chart), per-ISIN tolerant (Promise.allSettled), CORS + CDN\n  cache. Keeps the data source off the client and unblocks CORS.\n- Data layer: PortfolioDataContext/usePortfolioData, navService,\n  parseHoldingsFile (JSON/CSV, key aliases, validation), fundCatalog\n  (ISIN metadata + normalizeType + palette). portfolio.js gains pure\n  deriveMetrics/enrichFunds and DEFAULT_HOLDINGS; whole dashboard\n  recomputes from shares x NAV.\n- Holdings table: columns Fund | Shares | Cost | Actual | Value |\n  Gain/Loss (Type/Allocation/YTD removed). Cost/Actual/Value render as\n  whole-number compact (no decimals, no symbol); Gain/Loss stacked\n  euros over percent. European compact euro format (K/M, decimal comma,\n  EUR suffix). Fund column capped with ellipsis for column breathing room.\n- Allocation donut + Overview recompute from live data; asset mix uses\n  the imported type. Colours assigned by position so funds never collide.\n- Per-line error: an unpriceable fund shows \"Unavailable\" on its own row\n  and is excluded from totals/donut instead of failing the whole import.\n- Import UI in the TopBar (import/reset/status), sample files, and\n  .env.example (VITE_NAV_API_URL). Module Federation contract unchanged.\n\nTests: 83 passing (parser, service, api proxy, context, cards).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e01f60e0ae2c8ff1d3aebbb3578d15ff2b1037bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/trees/e01f60e0ae2c8ff1d3aebbb3578d15ff2b1037bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/fund-dashboard/git/commits/25409a98e6f8c9031f5d31e7afa086a6b61a9e2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1Mj