tted from.","tree":{"sha":"191bc9cc812d9629c6f31d194f4746f4786bb677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/191bc9cc812d9629c6f31d194f4746f4786bb677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/bac41cc0cc2b145a28ab93c4c685dec68c4abc44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/bac41cc0cc2b145a28ab93c4c685dec68c4abc44","node_id":"C_kwDOTZQWsNoAKGJhYzQxY2MwY2MyYjE0NWEyOGFiOTNjNGM2ODVkZWM2OGM0YWJjNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3","sha":"f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3"}],"sha":"bac41cc0cc2b145a28ab93c4c685dec68c4abc44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/bac41cc0cc2b145a28ab93c4c685dec68c4abc44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T07:13:09Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T07:13:09Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"feat: wire up review system in the frontend\n\nBookingSerializer now nests the booking''s review (null until one\nexists), so the frontend can tell whether a past booking is still\nawaiting a review without a separate request. MyBookingsView''s\nqueryset picks up select_related(''review'') to keep that free.\n\nFrontend: MyBookingsPage shows a star-rating ReviewForm for any past\nbooking without a review yet, and the submitted rating/comment once\none exists. ProviderDetailPage fetches and lists that provider''s\nreviews. New api/reviews.ts (getReviews, createReview) and a small\nreusable ReviewForm component.\n\nVerified against the live server: a booking''s review field is null\nright after creation, then correctly populated after POSTing a review\nthrough the same flow the UI uses.","tree":{"sha":"13376d8166ca2973e811d9b5eff6bf8ba8b36d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/13376d8166ca2973e811d9b5eff6bf8ba8b36d2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3","node_id":"C_kwDOTZQWsNoAKGY3YTliMWVhYzUwNzFiYzFmZjM4YjVhNGJkNmIzZWY2NTNiZjdkZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840","sha":"3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840"}],"sha":"f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/f7a9b1eac5071bc1ff38b5a4bd6b3ef653bf7df3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T07:00:54Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T07:00:54Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"feat: add review system\n\nNew reviews app: Review model (one per booking via OneToOneField,\n1-5 rating, optional comment). GET/POST /api/reviews/, filterable by\n?provider=<id>.\n\nA booking is \"completed\" once its Availability.end_time has passed —\nthere''s no separate booking-status lifecycle yet, so gating on time\navoided bolting a bigger unrelated feature onto this one. Enforced in\nReviewSerializer.validate_booking() alongside the ownership check\n(booking.client == request.user), both returning clean 400s. Creating\na review recomputes and stores the provider''s avg_rating.\n\n8 new tests covering: happy path, upcoming-booking rejection,\ncross-user rejection, duplicate-review rejection, out-of-range rating,\navg_rating recomputation across multiple reviews, public+filterable\nlisting, and the auth requirement. Verified by hand against the live\nserver too (create, duplicate rejection, avg_rating update, filtered\nlist).","tree":{"sha":"5d046a642f09534927e2afdc34acca50aa74f8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/5d046a642f09534927e2afdc34acca50aa74f8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840","node_id":"C_kwDOTZQWsNoAKDM4MDY3MzNjODRhMzI4NGI5MGRmM2Y0N2VkOWY1YmNkMGZjN2E4NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/62926ff5e4b9d5c7ba4473d133eda4aea8c50b5d","sha":"62926ff5e4b9d5c7ba4473d133eda4aea8c50b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/62926ff5e4b9d5c7ba4473d133eda4aea8c50b5d"}],"sha":"3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/3806733c84a3284b90df3f47ed9f5bcd0fc7a840"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/62926ff5e4b9d5c7ba4473d133eda4aea8c50b5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T06:45:51Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T06:45:51Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"ci: add GitHub Actions pipeline\n\nThree jobs on push/PR to main: backend-tests (Django test suite against\na real Postgres service container), frontend-check (oxlint, tsc, vite\nbuild), and docker-build (confirms backend/Dockerfile still builds).\n\nCaught a real bug via a local dry run before wiring this up: running\nmanage.py test from the repo root (the pattern the README documents for\nmigrate/runserver) silently discovers 0 tests instead of running the\nsuite, because Django''s test discovery resolves against the working\ndirectory rather than manage.py''s location. CI runs it from inside\nbackend/ instead, and the README now calls out the gotcha.","tree":{"sha":"4fab6ca7e99afd3b17cfe4