,"email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:56:59Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"feat: add provider-owner write endpoints\n\nProviderProfile and Service now support create/update, not just public\nread. Creating a profile is gated on role=''provider'' and limited to one\nper user; updates are restricted to the owning provider via object-level\npermissions (IsProfileOwnerOrReadOnly / IsServiceOwnerOrReadOnly).\nServices are managed at a flat /api/providers/services/, with the\nprovider inferred from the caller''s own profile rather than accepted\nfrom the request body.\n\nVerified the full permission matrix by hand: role-gating on profile\ncreation, duplicate-profile rejection, service creation blocked without\na profile, and cross-owner update attempts rejected on both profiles\nand services.","tree":{"sha":"a71f1b299d897a1c1c0130b4a2e7b16da259436e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/a71f1b299d897a1c1c0130b4a2e7b16da259436e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/66c458294d8ee7be2a91aa6456159d274b45052d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use