"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:20:52Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"fix: CORS configuration for frontend integration\n\nMissing comma in MIDDLEWARE caused Python to silently concatenate\nCorsMiddleware''s path with SecurityMiddleware''s into one bogus string,\nwhich would have crashed Django on startup. Also corrected the setting\nname (CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS isn''t a real django-cors-headers setting; it''s\nCORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS), since the typo''d version silently fell back to\nallowing no cross-origin requests at all.","tree":{"sha":"1d308525eb3da892682464053a1e02d4c77a801b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/1d308525eb3da892682464053a1e02d4c77a801b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/897aeb121315bddb1b3f0bea629751fe4bc2361e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/897aeb121315bddb1b3f0bea629751fe4bc2361e","node_id":"C_kwDOTZQWsNoAKDg5N2FlYjEyMTMxNWJkZGIxYjNmMGJlYTYyOTc1MWZlNGJjMjM2MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d","sha":"1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d"}],"sha":"897aeb121315bddb1b3f0bea629751fe4bc2361e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/897aeb121315bddb1b3f0bea629751fe4bc2361e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:31:57Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:31:57Z","email":"kiril@kiril.pl","name":"Kiril"},"message":"feat: run the full stack (db, redis, backend) via docker-compose\n\nAdds a redis service and a backend service built from backend/Dockerfile,\nwith a bind mount for live code reload. backend gets DB_HOST/DB_PORT\noverrides on top of the shared .env, since it reaches Postgres by\nservice name on the compose network instead of the host-mapped port\nDjango-on-the-host uses. db gets a healthcheck so backend actually\nwaits for Postgres to be ready instead of racing it on startup.","tree":{"sha":"5bc20733d09c73235004a70ef6bf1839de9dc366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/trees/5bc20733d09c73235004a70ef6bf1839de9dc366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/git/commits/1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214527574?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy","id":214527574,"login":"KirilShy","node_id":"U_kgDODMluVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KirilShy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/1bebebf2ccbda9811d4ba11607c69c06b75e0a2d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZQWsNoAKDFiZWJlYmYyY2NiZGE5ODExZDRiYTExNjA3YzY5YzA2Yjc1ZTBhMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KirilShy/LocalPro/commit/18af78528d45e8806b05cf9ca263c77d17d95f9c","sha":"18af78528d45e8806b05cf9ca263c77d17d95f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KirilShy/LocalPro/commits/18af78528d45e8806b05cf9ca263c77d17d95f9c"}],"sha":"1bebebf2ccbda9811