.com","name":"Fabio Organtini"},"message":"Reproduction: analog vite-plugin-angular loses AOT on federation-exposed modules\n\nDeterministic repro of a buildStart/transform race between\n@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular and @module-federation/vite: exposed\nmodules are pulled through analog''s transform while the initial\ncompilation is still running, fileEmitter misses, and the files fall\nthrough to plain esbuild as JIT decorator classes (runtime NG0202 /\n''JIT compiler unavailable'' in an AOT app).\n\nRun: npm install && npm run repro\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dc5de5ab8e40c255ae47f23150c92debe7642f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forgantini/analog-mf-aot-repro/git/trees/4dc5de5ab8e40c255ae47f23150c92debe7642f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forgantini/analog-mf-aot-repro/git/commits/dbad0d0ca2093bbc82e9f8693972c3b50590a34f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129367136?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/forgantini","id":129367136,"login":"forgantini","node_id":"U_kgDOB7X8YA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/forgantini","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/