commit/0e170dda913e72319ed8eaabf7e3c7bdc806a80d","node_id":"C_kwDOTZTgI9oAKDBlMTcwZGRhOTEzZTcyMzE5ZWQ4ZWFhYmY3ZTNjN2JkYzgwNmE4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/069d2ed21b9214b92e04870624c43e320b3a50a4","sha":"069d2ed21b9214b92e04870624c43e320b3a50a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/069d2ed21b9214b92e04870624c43e320b3a50a4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a","sha":"2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a"}],"sha":"0e170dda913e72319ed8eaabf7e3c7bdc806a80d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/0e170dda913e72319ed8eaabf7e3c7bdc806a80d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:12:49Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:12:49Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"docs: correct the MF share-key, error-count and failure-mode claims\n\nAddresses the independent review on #46. Docs only — no source changes.\n\n- The shared block lists two keys, but the plugin expands each to its imported\n  subpaths, so all three containers register FOUR (react, react/jsx-runtime,\n  react-dom, react-dom/client), each strictVersion: true. climb-trainer declares\n  the scoped pair explicitly; the shell and fund get them by expansion. Confirmed\n  in the built localSharedImportMap and in shareScopeMap.default at runtime. The\n  bullet deliberately does not claim which form is load-bearing — the \"explicit\n  pair is required\" finding was measured on an older plugin version and has not\n  been re-tested.\n- A forced mismatch logs four bridge-failure lines against a production build,\n  one per shared key — not six. The dev server splits the same control into two\n  at load plus four at first card open, per the documented materialize: false\n  behaviour, which is why the rule is to grep the string, not count lines.\n- The remote-unavailable case is ONE error at initial load (the browser refusing\n  the preloaded module''s MIME type), plus #RUNTIME-008 once per card open,\n  unbounded — not two errors per load.\n- \"The portfolio survives\" holds for FAST failures only. A hanging remoteEntry\n  leaves the page blank indefinitely (measured: #root empty at 15 s). This is\n  pre-existing and architectural — the fund remote hangs identically — but this\n  change adds a second origin that can cause it, and no timeout is added here.\n- Dropped the React-instance count as evidence: counting __reactFiber$ suffixes\n  reads 1 in the broken arm too, because a failed remote never creates a\n  renderer. The console grep is the only signal that discriminates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"753b8988d76cd06c19a30ce113e2e765f8afd324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/753b8988d76cd06c19a30ce113e2e765f8afd324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a","node_id":"C_kwDOTZTgI9oAKDI4OTVhY2EzNjc1ZTE4MDZiYmQ3YTJiZWYxZGU4NzZmZjA1MGVjMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/e9c66b6c0b68857ee9df41751ef687111ff87f2c","sha":"e9c66b6c0b68857ee9df41751ef687111ff87f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/e9c66b6c0b68857ee9df41751ef687111ff87f2c"}],"sha":"2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/2895aca3675e1806bbd7a2bef1de876ff050ec2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/e9c66b6c0b68857ee9df41751ef687111ff87f2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:18:45Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:18:45Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"feat: add the climbTrainer Module Federation remote\n\nSecond federated remote alongside fundDashboard: the climb-trainer app\n(React 19 + TanStack on a FastAPI/Neon Postgres backend), standalone at\nclimb.kilianmc.com.\n\n- vite.config.ts: climbTrainer remote, entry from VITE_CLIMB_REMOTE_URL with the\n  production default preserved. The shared block is unchanged — still react +\n  react-dom only, singleton, ^19.0.0, strictVersion: true.\n- src/types/remotes.d.ts: ambient decl for climbTrainer/App (the remote ships\n  dts: false).\n- src/data/projects.ts: card 03; the HTML-only example cards renumber to 04-06.\n- Vitest aliases the new bare specifier to the shared remote stub, without which\n  Vite''s import analysis fails under test.\n\nDo NOT promote this to main before climb-trainer''s first production promotion. A\nproduction build initialises remotes eagerly, so while\nclimb.kilianmc.com/remoteEntry.js still answers 200 text/html the page logs two\nerrors on every load. The portfolio itself survives — the card falls back to its\nErrorBoundary — but it would be cosmetic damage on kilianmc.com. Recorded in\nCLAUDE.md.\n\nAlso corrects three CLAUDE.md claims found while verifying: only climbTrainer\nshares the scoped react/ and react-dom/ keys (the host and fundDashboard share\njust react and react-dom); the bridge-failure log is not reliably four lines (a\nforced mismatch produced six), so grep the string rather than counting; and the\nPR template no longer references the removed chrome89 build target.\n\nPairs with kilianmc/climb-trainer#20.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f3daf64b876837b11606a8e5c7a144fe8eaced0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/8f3daf64b876837b11606a8e5c7a144fe8eaced0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/e9c66b6c0b68857ee9df41751ef687111ff87f2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use