essage":"fix: add Escape/focus-trap/focus-restore a11y to ProjectViewer\n\nExtract a shared useOverlayA11y hook (Escape-to-close, focus trap over the\noverlay chrome, focus-restore to the launching trigger) and consume it in\nboth ProjectViewer and JournalViewer for consistent modal behavior. The\ncross-origin embedded iframe can''t be focus-managed by the parent once\nfocus enters it; documented in the hook. Additive a11y only — MF host\ncontract and iframe integration untouched.\n\nCloses #32\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba3b6f5eda2e8b88a8f5d10037b7de62a5653d52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/ba3b6f5eda2e8b88a8f5d10037b7de62a5653d52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/78877cf732b1efc7cb514bf51ab982b53d22881b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/78877cf732b1efc7cb514bf51a