ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/03619738f5dc036d391d5449c8ba10d9b7637afa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:30:46Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:30:46Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"refactor(ts): migrate shell to TypeScript\n\nMigrate the portfolio shell to TypeScript (strict). All src is now .ts/.tsx\nwith real types (component prop interfaces, Experience/Project data models,\nevent/ref types). Adds strict tsconfig(.node).json, an ambient decl for the\n`fundDashboard/App` remote (src/types/remotes.d.ts), typescript-eslint in the\nflat config, an `npm run typecheck` step in the lint-build CI job, and bumps\nto 1.2.0.\n\nMF host contract intact: chrome89 target, react/react-dom singletons ^18.2.0,\ndts:false, and the lazy React.lazy/Suspense/ErrorBoundary remote-loading\npattern are all preserved; the build still emits the host and loads\n`fundDashboard/App`. The fund-dashboard remote intentionally stays plain JS\n(the fast/simple copilot project) — a deliberate contrast to the typed shell.\n\nCloses #11\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aca48000dfe86f6d0803800fc3a5a480248f7244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/aca48000dfe86f6d0803800fc3a5a480248f7244"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/03619738f5dc036d391d5449c8ba10d9b7637afa","verification"