er; no @import, no Sass deprecation warnings. Mechanical\nconversion only — identical selectors/values/cascade, zero visual change\n(Kilian signed off on a local preview). index.css removed.\n\nBundled: Vercel Web Analytics on the host — @vercel/analytics/react,\n<Analytics /> rendered once at the App root (host only, not the remote).\n\nMF host contract untouched (remotes, react singletons, chrome89, dts:false).\nCloses #10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c43914c57d975b1aee54371757544fdef15d9c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/c43914c57d975b1aee54371757544fdef15d9c25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/056685f186cd43de803a90666a336f7ee4cfc419","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commit/056685f186cd43de803a90666a336f7ee4cfc419","node_id":"C_kwDOTZTgI9oAKDA1NjY4NWYxODZjZDQzZGU4MDNhOT