40?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/commits/8950cdfb8f7763bb2acd93b8dff67a403968e5b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:43:28Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:43:28Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"test: add Vitest + React Testing Library with initial tests\n\nSet up Vitest with React Testing Library and jsdom for the host, and add\na meaningful first suite covering the shell''s resilience surface.\n\n- Add devDeps: vitest, @testing-library/{react,jest-dom,user-event}, jsdom.\n- Configure Vitest via the test block in vite.config.js (jsdom env, globals,\n  src/test/setup.js with jest-dom matchers + matchMedia stub).\n- Skip the Module Federation plugin under Vitest (process.env.VITEST) so jsdom\n  can run; dev/build keep federation active (build still emits remoteEntry and\n  the loadRemote fundDashboard/App chunk). Alias fundDashboard/App to a local\n  stub for tests; the failure path overrides it with a throwing vi.mock.\n- Add scripts: test (watch) and test:run (once).\n- Tests: ErrorBoundary (children vs fallback + standalone link), ProjectViewer\n  (loading, remote resolves, and the remote-failure path exercised via a\n  rejecting mock -> ErrorBoundary fallback), and data shape assertions for\n  projects.js / experience.js.\n- CI: run npm run test:run in the existing lint-build job; add top-level\n  permissions (contents: read) and a concurrency block (PR #5 review nits).\n- eslint: drop the dead scripts/** glob (no such dir); keep *.config.js Node\n  globals.\n- Docs: update CLAUDE.md Commands/testing notes.\n\nCloses #3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7dfa0fb0692b10cf490143d02c37924aa451c08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/a7dfa0fb0692b10cf490143d02c37924aa451c08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/8950cdfb8f7763bb2acd93b8dff67a403968e5b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us