s.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:26:13Z","email":"13885240+kilianmc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kilian Mateo"},"message":"chore: add ESLint + Prettier + GitHub Actions CI\n\nAdd lint/format tooling and a CI gate for this Module Federation host,\nmirroring the fund-dashboard conventions (plain JS/JSX, no TypeScript).\n\n- ESLint flat config (eslint.config.js) for React 18 + hooks + jsx-a11y,\n  with eslint-config-prettier last; ignores dist/ and node_modules/.\n- Prettier config (.prettierrc, .prettierignore) matched to the existing\n  code style (single quotes, semicolons, 2-space, trailing commas).\n- npm scripts: lint, lint:fix, format, format:check; new devDependencies.\n- GitHub Actions CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml), job `lint-build`, running\n  npm ci -> lint -> format:check -> build on Node from .nvmrc (23.10.0).\n  No test step yet (tracked in #3).\n- Document the new commands in CLAUDE.md.\n\nMF host contract untouched (remotes, React singletons, chrome89 target).\n\nCloses #2","tree":{"sha":"6e719fb453a8894fdace26353da8ad14ed5013f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/trees/6e719fb453a8894fdace26353da8ad14ed5013f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kilianmc/portfolio-shell/git/commits/a3cf285bb2d5203bb6e5b784f0c547c64816d995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13885240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilianmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kilianmc","id":13885240,"login":"kilianmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODg1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user