rs/catalint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catalint/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catalint","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catalint/telic/commits/03588b23d97c68a35cbcf1ce5a1e7753ada293b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T16:47:16Z","email":"catalint@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Tanasescu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T16:47:16Z","email":"catalint@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Tanasescu"},"message":"ci: conventions-gate + all-package packaging checks + full-subpath consumer matrix\n\nStreamlines the review loop by turning mechanical finding-classes into\npermanent gates:\n\n- scripts/conventions-gate.ts (bun run conventions, wired into check + the\n  release ladder): initiative-boundary, .js-extension imports, zero-dep core,\n  no module-scope browser globals, exports<->size-budget parity.\n- ci.yml: publint on all three packages + attw on react (D24 shipped a broken\n  react because only core was checked); fix the mislabeled build step.\n- consumer-smoke: all-subpaths.ts re-export barrel so the TS-floor matrix parses\n  every published subpath''s .d.ts, not just the three the fixture imports.\n- release.yml: workspace-range guard now also covers optionalDependencies.\n- copilot-instructions: the semantic bug-classes this review surfaced\n  (prototype-key lookups, exposure recoverability, dedup/flush ordering,\n  CI-stable output, keyed/parked idempotency) — the ones a grep can''t catch.","tree":{"sha":"920c8756f9b4f8e62c983b20a18f21238fed0e0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catalint/telic/git/trees/920c8756f9b4f8e62c983b20a18f21238fed0e0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catalint/telic/git/commits/03588b23d97c68a35cbcf1ce5a1e7753ada293b9","verification":{"payload":"tree 920c8756f9b4f8e62c983b20a18f21238fed0e0c\nparent acf812f5f275ea1f6bcf85f50003a86c8f510123\nauthor Catalin Tanasescu <catalint@gmail.com> 1784220436 +0300\ncommitter Catalin Tanasescu <catalint@gmail.com> 1784220436 +0300\n\nci: conventions-gate + all-package packaging checks + full-subpath consumer matrix\n\nStreamlines the review loop by turning mechanical finding-classes into\npermanent gates:\n\n- scripts/conventions-gate.ts (bun run conventions, wired into check + the\n  release ladder): initiative-boundary, .js-extension imports, zero-dep core,\n  no module-scope browser globals, exports<->size-budget parity.\n- ci.yml: publint on all three packages + attw on react (D24 shipped a broken\n  react because only core was checked); fix the mislabeled build step.\n- consumer-smoke: all-subpaths.ts re-export barrel so the TS-floor matrix parses\n  every published subpath''s .d.ts, not just the three the fixture imports.\n- release.yml: workspace-range guard now also covers optionalDependencies.\n- copilot-instructions: the semantic bug-classes this review surfaced\n  (prototype-key lookups, exposure recoverability, dedup/flush ordering,\n  CI-stable output, keyed/parked idempotency) — the ones a grep can''t catch.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEnawDhGF2ABwcT30zeRw5g1dn8RwFAmpZCxQACgkQeRw5g1dn\n8RxtoQ//RWtLbH0zrQuxjoCJ5exfjsIiF8Hp6VqN4s6KaqiPu4PjL4NQbDOfOchj\n4yzfTf8N8j2Dp07ob2+EPVlmQxxCGObPzdZ6tGF3fjm1bYwVfB9JPm40FTaKoWoY\ngAaPwY6HpdLKC/rfOTQ7e9UV+zv/NLgMfNStt4VL55m1lNyaJrxpCeigE1JBznC4\nlgpwpSNYvVLDd9kSq9JshxN3+sf8j7fuMAD/5ZmgSZoMdRHRIeC1AhvtVwUlRGB/\nIMs2I/CovZxiGkI2Mo0M65X4VwWGJ6dDivTaR0/4TwOM/GmOmz6z6G7uPzOd0wyw\nt0GpH4zk/sdJcQqmhmuW/bB/L2c3eD6y0XNUD1rn4HD6mvk4EXog8rUuN2UiyITC\ndE+zcHt1MSCvfDeJ8TQsfKNJUT0DcvsVJ2QnGC6YHgpQrf8sEteAt+R7Wmu59Z6k\nCNlhwJKQoBE5uTAlqmrRIIqZbd9qyCg/7WRF5GGCTQY0INXCgzENAqFywBxE24Tl\nUSPkICAKhT/Njft+BxIfocrtX9trGMWA3X1NfzN0PC65X7yO+4XhJWRInGNZG8SW\nVGLyGwo8XSDS2/6shxalqN60mm0wOwnZGXBijHiaN8U4ox+TrPT/dFBR6Tmb9va8\nZeI5AujMXNzr2vrKEBDiY+/e9VQ90csb5vOg4siuf8fppoZCTUY=\n=a0Tc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_a